<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Omaki</para>
  <para style="toc1">ƐZA Iyeshi Iyi I Ngyi Mu Kwuwo Ungwu OMAKI</para>
  <para style="toc2">Omaki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Omk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Omaki</para>
  <para style="imt1">KAMBU IYEMO</para>
  <para style="ip">Omaki, uwu bɔkɔ e wo ɛduma iyi anu itama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi lɔri guruguru mbala Ɔpɔlu mbala Obana awu gba a ka kwokpo kwɔlɛ le. Uwu akwu uwu kwonze uwu bɔkɔ a ka apula iyi i wo kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ozhizɔsi e yi mu Kwudukwɔlɛ awu. Omaki a wa la apula iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e wo a ta yi kwudu ndunduu mu kwokpo kwɔlɛ i ka iyi bɔkɔ Omatiyu mbala Oluku mbala Ɔzhɔnu o ka mu ekpo mbo ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwokpo kwɔlɛ ku ba wɔzhi laa ungwu Omatiyu mbala ungwu Oluku mbala ungwu Ɔzhɔnu mo, tetete, iso iyi bɔkɔ i yi mangu indomo i ka iyifo ɛlɛ ma. Miyiyemo Omaki a ba ɛza iyi ɛduma iyi izele iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e wo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Omaki a zɔ gedegede tee Ɔzhizɔsi akwu onzu u wo ɛduma laa idomo. Iso wu gyɔɔ akwu mu apula iyi bɔkɔ i wo mu afyi imbwambwa iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, akwɛyi a mbwa mu iso iyi lukwu undu Usama mbala iyimo wu mu Ogariwu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Mɛmi</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔzhɔnu U wo obatisima a ngbɛ ɔgwuzɛ laa Ɔzhizɔsi 1.1 - 13</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛduma iyi efya ibomo mbala ɛzu izɔma 1.14 - 8.26</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu 8.27 - 10.45</para>
  <para style="io1">Ozhriko mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ 10.46 - 13.37</para>
  <para style="io1">Inyashi iyi Okrasi mbala lukwu wu 14.1 - 15.47</para>
  <para style="io1">Okrasi uwu e yimo mOgariwu mbala wa mbwaluwu 16.1 - 20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhɔnu U Wo Obatisima A Ta Anu Iyi Iso Iyeshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Omatiyu 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Oluku 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Ɔzhɔnu 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Ɛza iyesheshi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, Umɛ uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />I ye kyamate bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo ungwu anukenzu Azaya awu tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">&lt;&lt;Imi mi lɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ mi ma kaa le tekeyi la ŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">uwu bɔkɔ a ba ngbɛ ŋɔ ɔgwuzɛ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />&lt;&lt;opwu uwu onzu u yi mu iyama mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara, u zɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">&lt;La lu ngbɛ ɔgwuzɛ laa Ɔkwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">la lu bɔ wu ɛgwuzɛ wu a shɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu a wɔ e le mu obatisima iwomo mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara mbala anu itama tee enzu lo tamɛzhi laa Ukpo kaa lo gba la ingbomo mbo lo kpa mba. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Enzu umba ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya mbala umba Ɔzhɛrusalɛ lɛɛbi o wɔ kwudu o ka mbaa wu. Onzonzu e so ingbomo wu akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu e wo mbo obatisima kpɛkpɛ mba mu ɔkwu uwu Ɔzhɔda. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Ɔzhɔnu e kpo ekpayi iyi bɔkɔ o fu mu inyi iyi Onyakurumi laa kwumamuzhi ungwu kwokpo ungwu izɔfyi. Kiya ingyirimo wu akwu eko mbala lotu undu ɔsɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />A tanu tee: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo uwu bɔkɔ a ka mi ekpasu ma e yi mu inyɔma mizhikembo mi. Ekyikyi iyi ekpoyata wu lala mi do te mi kwumo kaa la mi vuvu yi ma mo. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Imi mi ye yi mu obatisima iwomo mu embyi, uwu ba a ba nyɔ awu, ee wo yi obatisima mu Kwundu Ɔkɛrikɛri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obatisima Mbala Ipwama Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Omatiyu 3.13—4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Oluku 3.21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ mu Ɔnazarɛti mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili akwɛyi a ka mbaa Ɔzhɔnu akwɛyi e wo wu obatisima mu ɔkwu uwu Ɔzhɔda. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu iwɔma mu embyi, akwɛyi a ma oshi te u wuma gboo akwɛyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo a wɔ moshi kyamate ogarikwokwo tayi akwɛyi e kwu mawu, <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />akwɛyi opwu u wɔ moshi u zɔ tee: &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu Umɛ, uwu idɛnyi mi; Mi mwɔnyɛ mbala ŋa gyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Kɛlɛlɛ! Kwundu uwu Ukpo e to wu a ka wa mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔ mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara mɔmɔ afyi uwekpendo. AKwɛyi Onzu uwoyi a pwa wu ma. Izɔfyi umbira oyi mɔmɔ, Alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo gba o koko o mbwa wu ma le.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyama Iyi Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Umba Kwonze.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Omatiyu 4.12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Oluku 4.14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Mizhikembo iyi o ta Ɔzhɔnu mu ugu ugyi, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ka mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili la anu itama iyi ilɔ iyesheshi iyi Ukpo tee, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye kwu bo-o,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo kwu ndafo. La lu kwu ira yi ɔsu, la lu kwu idu lu fulo mu ilɔ iyi iyesheshi ɛlɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Ɔnu uwufo, Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu luzɛ mu kenzu unga risu ingyi Ogalili akwɛyi a ma Ɔsamɔ mbala umanyiwu, Anduru te o yi mu ɛya ifumo mu risu, moo ɛduma mba akwu emu iyimo. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee &lt;&lt;La lu bo kaa lu mbwalu mi akwɛyi mi zɔ yi ewo iyi lu nya la enzu munyi mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Akwɛyi mɔmɔɔmɔ, o lafya la iya mba akwɛyi o mbwalu wu.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Tabɔkɔ e turu a gba keyi bwɛɛ, akwɛyi a ma Ozhemisi umɛ uwu Ɔzɛbɛdi mbala umanyi wu, Ɔzhɔnu mu kwoda ungwu embyi mu iya mba inɔngɔma. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Umba tete Ɔzhizɔsi a ya mba ma te lo mbwalu wu. Ɔ ngbɛ kwuye mo ndii akwɛyi o lafya la ete mbo, Ɔzɛbɛdi mbala enzu umba ɛduma wu mu kwoda akwɛyi o mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Wa La Kwundu Ungura Ma Mu Ɛnwu Iyi Onzu Uwufo.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Oluku 4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu, o ka mu Okapanawu akwɛyi ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo ungwu Azhu, o fye mu udaba uwu Azhu akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e le mu enzu ɛzu izɔma mɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Izele i yi enzu ma gyɔɔ kwuwongu ɛzu izɔma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi ɛlɛ, moo a zɔ mba ɛzu la ekpasu kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi idomo tayi, akwu kyamate wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi mo. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Kporo ba onzu uwufo meka mba uwu bɔkɔ e yi kwundu ungwura e fye mu udaba uwu Azhu akwɛyi a tara oga kpaa a zɔ tee, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />&lt;&lt;Uŋɔ Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti, i ta ŋa te mbala nzu? Ŋɔ bo te kaa ngbɛ nzu ma re? Imi mi yitu ŋɔ. Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu Ɔkɛrikɛri uwu Ukpo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a kpa wu ɛyi, a za wu tee &lt;&lt;Kpala kenzu mo! Wɔma mu ɛnwu wu kekelele!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Akwɛyi kwundu ungwura kwɔngu kwu wo onzu awu akpa kwu fya wu mu ɛzhi, akwɛyi kwu wɔ ma mu ɛnwu wu la oga itarama.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Izele i yi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ ma gyɔɔ akwɛyi o le mu esu kwuyo iyomo tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ ba akwumbe ngyɔɔ? Ele akwu onzu a zɔ ɛzɔ iyepo la idomo le! Ɛndu iyira lala a kpa yi ɛyi ba i lo wu moo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Ɛza wu i le mu ifulama efyefya mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili lɛɛbi.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Enzu Gyɔɔ Efya Ma.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Omatiyu 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Oluku 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Tabɔkɔ o yimo mu udaba uwu Azhu awu, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Ozhemisi mbala Ɔzhɔnu o ka mu kwogba ungwu Ɔsamɔ mbala Anduru. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Akwɛyi mu kwotota kwɔngu o za la Ɔzhizɔsi tee anyi wu oko uwu Ɔsamɔ, a mwɔnyɛ mo, a nɔma la okpakyi. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ka mbaa wu, e yi wu mu kwuwo akwɛyi e yi wu mo a rima. Mu kwotota kwɔngu okpakyi wu e bomo akwɛyi e le mbo mu kiya ingyirimo iwomo.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Mu eyikpomo iyi ɔnungawu, o ka la Ɔzhizɔsi enzu umba efya mbala umba bɔkɔ o yi ɛndu iyira. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Enzu umba kwuse lɛɛbi o kpala ɛlu mu kenzugu unga kwogba kwɔngu. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ o yi efya ikikɔ ikikɔ, Ɔzhizɔsi e bo yi mbo mo lɛɛbi. E kyo a wa la ɛndu iyira ma mu ɛnwu iyi enzu. Ɛndu iyira ɛnyi i yitu te Ɔzhizɔsi akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo. Tetete Ɔzhizɔsi a nya yi ma te li siso mo.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Tanu Mu Ogalili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Oluku 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Mu kwoto mu kwoto kwuyengwu eyi i di mbwa iyama mo, Ɔzhizɔsi e yimo a lafya la kwogba akwɛyi a ka mu kizɛ ingyifo kɛɛkyi wu mbaa Ukpo ilɛma. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔsamɔ mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala wu o ma Ɔzhizɔsi mo, akwɛyi ɔ wɔ kaa lo gagyi wu. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o ma wu, o za wu te: &lt;&lt; Onzu uwunawuna e ye ŋɔ mu igagyima!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba mba opwu a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La ki so mu kizɛ ingyifo ŋa, la ki so mu ese iyifo ɛkɛlɛkɛlɛ kaa la mi tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo mɔmɔ tete, moo akwu kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba mi bo le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi a kpa ɛvyɛ mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili lɛɛbi la anu itama mu idaba iyi Azhu la ɛndu iyira irama mu ɛnwu iyi enzu.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Onzu Uwu Ofya Umbwu Embyi Umbɔyi ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Omatiyu 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Oluku 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Ɔnu uwufo onzu uwufo uwu e yi ofya umbwu embyi umbɔyi a ka mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi, e kwumo, a bɔ epunu mɛzhi akwɛyi a kpa wu ɛshɛku, a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada, gba ŋɔ nyama, ŋɔ do te ŋɔ bo ofya mi mbɔlɛ ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Inyashi wu i wo Ɔzhizɔsi mo gyɔɔ akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a wa la kwuwo akwɛyi a pwa wu afyi. A za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi nyama.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ofya ŋa u bo o!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Mɔmɔ-ɔmɔ ofya wu umbu embibɔyi u bomo, akwɛyi ɛnwu wu i wulu ma.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te le sheyimo iyawu akwɛyi a ta wu ɔkpa te, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />&lt;&lt;Ki so onzu uwunawuna iso ɛlɛ mo. Uŋɔ ba so kaa zɔ ɛŋɔ ma mbaa obwoshi uwu Ukpo akwɛyi ŋɔ wo isabɔ iyi bɔkɔ Omosisi a ta okpa te lo wo awu kaa lakwu kɛzɔ unga ibomo iyi ofya ŋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Tetete, onzu ele a wɔ kwudu akwɛyi e le mu enzu ebwu ifumo iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e wo wu. Ɛlɛ i shi Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu kwuse gedegede fo kwuwongu riba ingyi enzu. A ka ŋɔ mizhikembo iyi kwuse mbaa bɔkɔ enzu o yi mo. Tetete enzu ɔ wɔ mu ɛzhi ikikɔ ikikɔ o ka munyi wu.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Ukpokapiya Ofya Ma.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Omatiyu 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Oluku 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Mizhikembo iyi afyi bwɛ akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a ka mu Okapanawu, kwuse wu akwɛyi enzu o pwa yi. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Enzu guruguru o ko du wu mu kwogba mbaa bɔkɔ e yi awu. Kwɔgba kwu nyɔlɔma kpakiri i kyo kenzugwu, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ta mba anu iyi iso iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Enzu umbafo wendo o to ukpokapiya o ka wu mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kwuwongwu riba ingyi enzu, o fya ɔgwuzɛ kaa lo so la onzu uwu ofya ele mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi mo. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, o lu kwɔtu mu kɛnu unga ugu mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔ akwɛyi o ngye la onzu ukpokapiya ele nzhii ba o shi wu mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi la ɔkyɔ uwu inɔma wu ngyɔɔ . <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma ikwu idu lu fulo mbo, akwɛyi a za la ukpokapiya awu te, &lt;&lt;Umɛ mi, o gba la ingbomo ŋɔ o kpa ŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Akwɛyi wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ, o le mu anu izɔma mu egbo mbo te, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi onzu ele e siso ɛlɛ te? Ɛlɛ akwu ari! A kwu Ukpo kɛɛkyi moo uwe bɔkɔ e do te a gba la ingbomo iyi onzu a kpa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Mu kwotota, Ɔzhizɔsi a wa iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu egbo mbo akwɛyi e yo mbo te &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi lu byi egbo ɛlɛ mu akɔ yi? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Iyina i ka fulele le, I za la onzu ukpokapiya ele te &lt;Yimo, to ɔkyɔ ŋɔ ma kaa ku luzɛ ŋɔ,&gt; nana i za wu te, &lt;Ingbomo ŋɔ o gba yi o kpa ŋa&gt;? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Kekelele mi gyi te la mi zɔ yi kaa la lu yitu te Imi, Umɛ uwu Onzu mi yi ekpasu iyi mi gba la ingbomo iyi onzu mi kpa mu kwudu kwɔlɛ....&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a za la ukpokapiya awu te, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />&lt;&lt;Yimo, to ɔkyɔ ŋɔ ma kaa sheye mogba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Akwɛyi e yimo, e to ɔkyɔ wu ma akwɛyi akwu luzɛ wu gedegede la eyi mbo lɛɛbi. Ɛlɛ i shi uwewe izele akwɛyi enzu o le mu Ukpo iduma , ɔ zɔ te &lt;&lt;Ki di ma ɛlɛ te dɛ mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ya Olevi Ma Te La Mbwalu WU</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Omatiyu 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Oluku 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a wɔ kwudu a ka mu kenzu unga risu ingyi Ogalili. Enzu gyɔɔ o mbwalu wu mɔmɔ akwɛyi e le mbo mu iso iyi Ukpo izɔma. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Tabɔkɔ e yi mu luzɛ mu kenzu unga risu ngyɛngyi, akwɛyi a ma Olevi, umɛ uwu Alufiyɔ te a ŋɔma mu kwunu ungwu ɔba uwu ɛzhi inama. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Yimo ka mbwalu mi,&gt;&gt; akwɛyi Olevayi e yimo a mbwalu wu.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o ka mogba uwu Olevayi te kaa lo ri kiya ingyi onoyo, enzu gyɔɔ o mbwalu wu akwɛyi enzu wa na oba uwɛzhi mbala enzu umba ingbomo tete o le mu kiya irimo mbala Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />kwuye ungwu enzu wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu uzhi uwu Afarisi umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ, o ma te Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu kiya irimo mbala &lt;&lt;enzu umba ingbomo&gt;&gt; mbala enzu wa na ɔba uwɛzhi, akwɛyi o yo Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhizɔsi te: &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi e ri kiya mbala enzu wa na oba uwɛzhi mbala &lt;enzu umba ingbomo&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa, a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a mwɔnyɛ mo gba a gagyi u lo epu le, moo akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi ɔkpara uwu ɛnwu mo. Imi mi bo le, akwu kwuwo ungwu enzu umba ingbomo, moo akwu kwuwo ungwu enzu umba ototo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwuyo Mɛka Iyi Kenyo Irima.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Omatiyu 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Oluku 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Ɔnu uwufo Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima mbala Wavɔngɔkiya umba Afarisi o ra la kenyo. Akwɛyi enzu umbafo o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi o yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima mbala Wavɔngɔkiya umba Afarisi o ra la kenyo, umba ŋa ba o ra la kenyo mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu e yo mbo te, &lt;&lt; I shoshi te ɛmɛza umba ɔnu uwu okopo lo to kenyo kwuyengwu e yi mbala mba? O do te o wo tayi mo nzhii ba kwuyengwu e yi mbala mba fo. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma memowu bɔkɔ o to ɔnu uwu okopo awu ma munyi mbo, mu ɔnungawu gba o to kenyo le.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />&lt;&lt;Onzu e kpolo kwukokpayi mu okpayi uwepo akwɛyi a ki ngwu mu okpayi uwekyi mo. Moo gba e wo tayi, kwukokpayi ungwepo kwɔngu kwu tara okpayi uwekyi awu makwu kyo. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Tatayi onzu e fu ubyi uwu inyima uwepo mu ogya uwekyi mo. Moo gba e wo tayi, ubyi uwu inyima uwepo ɔnwu u yi mo akwɛyi ɔgya awu e kpo kpaa akwɛyi ubyi uwu inyima uwu ɔgya uwu ɔnwu u fu mo mɛzhi shaa. Ubyi uwepo gba o fu mu ɔgya uwepo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwuyo Mɛka Iyi Kwɔfyi Ungwu Ɛnwu Igbomo Ungwu Azhu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Omatiyu 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Oluku 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo ungufo, Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yi mu luzɛ mu utu uwu awa akwɛyi o mu imwuma iyi ewiri iyi utu o le mu irimo. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Tabɔkɔ Afarisi umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ o ma mba, akwɛyi o ko yo Ɔzhizɔsi te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi Wavɔngɔkiya ŋa o wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ɛrama i nyama te lo wo ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba mba opwu e yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Lu du wa yi dɛ mo re, kiya ingyi Odevidi e wo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ uwu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala wu bɔkɔ lonzu lu wo mbo mo akwɛyi o gagyi kiya kaa lo ri? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Akwɛyi e fye mu ugu uwu Ukpo akwɛyi e to kwoburodi ungwu bɔkɔ obwoshi uwakɔ kɛɛkyi gba i fa te le ri le akwɛyi Odevidi e ri akwɛyi e shi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala wu awu o ri tete. Ɛlɛ i wo kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Abiyata gba akwu obwoshi uwakɔ le awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo o wo ngwu kwuwongu onzu, moo o wo onzu kwuwongu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mo <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ , Umɛ uwu Onzu, gba kwu Ɔkwu uwu Kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo le tete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Onzu Uwu Kwuwo Wu Kwu Kpokapiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Omatiyu 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Oluku 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Kwuye kwowa Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu udaba uwu Azhu akwɛyi e du onzu uwufo mɔmɔ uwu bɔkɔ kwuwo wu kwu kpokapiya. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Enzu umbafo mɔmɔ ba o yi mu kwuyi igagyima kaa lo yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo la ingbomo. kwuwo ngwɔlɛ o le mu eyi lomo kaa lo ma shi Ɔzhizɔsi e bo onzu ele ofya ma ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za la onzu uwu ofya awu te &lt;&lt;Bo kaa rima mu keyi te.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo enzu mbamba te &lt;&lt;Iyina bɔkɔ ishoshi te lo wo ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo: lo wo iyeshi nana lo wo iyira ŋa, lɔ sa kwunyɔ nana lɔ ngbɛngwu ma ŋa?&gt;&gt; Umba ba o kpala kenzu mo.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Ɔzhizɔsi a bɔ mba eyeshii la amba kwuwongu egbo iyira mba, akwɛyi a za la onzu awu te &lt;&lt;Ndakwuwo ŋɔ ma.&gt;&gt; Tabɔkɔ onzu awu a ndakwuwo wu ma, akwɛyi kwuwo kwɔngu kwu gba odedengwu. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Tabɔkɔ Afarisi ɔ ma tayi, akwɛyi ɔ wɔ kwudu mu kwotota kwɔngu akwɛyi o le mu amasa ikama mbala enzu umba Ɛrɔdu kaa lɔ ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi ma.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Riba Ingyi Enzu Ɔ Mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi Mu Kenzu Unga Risu Ingyi Ogalili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yimo o ka mu risu ingyi Ogalili akwɛyi enzu guruguru mu Ogalili mbala Ozhudiya, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, Idumiya, mbala ɛzhi iyi ɔ sa risu ingyi Ɔzhɔda ma, mbala ese iyi Otaya mbala Ɔsidɔ o bo kwuwongu ɔ pwa iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu iwomo lɛɛbi le. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Kwuwongwu a gyi te enzu lo kpa wu ma mo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu te lo gagyi kwoda ungwu embyi ungwɛri kaa lo ka wu. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ɛlɛ e wo te kwuwongu enzu umba ofya guruguru o yi mu ishiri o ka munyi wu kaa lɔ pwa wu afyi, moo e bo enzu gyɔɔ efya ma-a. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Kwuye ungwunanguna bɔkɔ enzu umba ɛndu iyira ɔ ma Ɔzhizɔsi, o fumo mɛzhi mu idu wu la oga itarama te, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ kwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a ta mba okpa te lo so onzu uwunawuna te uwu akwu onzu ele te mo.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ŋa Wa zɛ ilɔ Wewo La Wepo.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Omatiyu 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Oluku 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yimo a ka mu lɔwa akwɛyi a lɔ la enzu umba bɔkɔ uwu a gyi akwɛyi ɔ ka. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />A ŋa enzu wewo la wepo mekeka mba kaa lo kwu wa zɛ ilɔ wu, kaa lo yi mbala wu, kaa le koko la lɔ mba ma mbaa anu itama iyi i so wu. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Ɔzhizɔsi e kyo e shi mbo ekpasu kaa lɔ ra la ɛndu iyira ma mu ɛnwu iyi enzu. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ɛnyi iyi enzu wewo la wepo umba bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋa gba i ŋɔ le: Ɔsamɔ(uwu bɔkɔ e kpo wu ɛnyi te Opita awu); <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Ozhemisi, umɛ uwu Ɔzɛbɛdi mbala umanyiwu, Ɔzhɔnu(umba bɔkɔ e kpo mbo ɛnyi te Abonagi, iyi bɔkɔ iluma yi i yi te Ɛmɛ umba Ina awu); <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Anduru, Ofilipu, Obatolomi, Omatiyu, Otoma, Ozhemisi umɛ uwu Alufiyɔ, Ɔtadiyɔ, Ɔsamɔ Ɔzilɔtu <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />mbala Ozhuda Isikariyɔ uwu bɔkɔ e to Ɔzhizɔsi a ya wu ma awu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Ɔbɛzɛbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Omatiyu 12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Oluku 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yimo o ka mu riyɔga mba mu Okapanawu. Enzu guruguru o gba o gyiri wu ma kpɔ nzhii ba uwu mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o fya kwuye ka lo ri kiya mo. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Tabɔkɔ ɛmanyi wu o pwa tayi akwɛyi o ka kaa lo ngye wu, moo enzu umbafo o yi mu isomo te &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi e kporishi-e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Akwɛyi wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi umba bɔkɔ o ngyi mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ awu o le mu enzu isomo te &lt;&lt;Ɔbɛɛzɛbu, u to keyi uwu ɛndu iyira e fye mu Ɔzhizɔsi-e! Inyi gba i shi wu ekpasu gba a wa la ɛndu iyira ma mu ɛnwu iyi enzu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi a ya mba ma akwɛyi e so mbo iso mu aba te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwoyi e do te a ra la Onzu uwoyi umanyiwu ma? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Gba enzu umba ɛzhi ikpɛnyi o to ewa mbala esu, ɛzhi ɛnyi i rima mo. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Gba enzu umba kwogba kwukpɛnyi kwu to ewa mbala esu iyɔkpɔɔ, kwogba kwɔngu kwu kpomo. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Tayi, gba onzu uwoyi e to ewa mbala onzu uwoyi akwɛyi ɔ kama yɛyɛ, de ba e kpɛdɔ ma. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e fye mu kwogba ungwu onzu uwu ekpasu akwɛyi akwu wu apula ma ba a kpa wu akyi dɛ mo, e yi mo. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Imi la mi so yi ongbulolo tee, ingbomo iyinayina iyi onzu e ngbo, mbala Ukpo ari ipemo, o gba yi okpa wu. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e pe Kwundu Ɔkɛrikɛri ari ba i gba yi kpa wu iyi gbee mo. Moo ingbomo wu ɛnyi akwu iyɔkpɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />E so tayi kwuwongu o yi mu isomo te &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi e yi kwundu ungwura.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anyi wu Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Ɛmanyi wu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Omatiyu 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Oluku 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi akwɛyi ɛmanyi mba Ɔzhizɔsi mbala anyi mba o ngyi o ri mu kwudu. Akwɛyi o lɔ onzu te la ya mba Ɔzhizɔsi ma. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Akwɛyi riba ingyi enzu umba o fula wu ma o za wu te &lt;&lt;Ɛnɛ ŋɔ mbala ɛmɛnɛ ŋɔ anzɔnu mbala ekokpayi o yi mu kwudu o gyi te lo ma ŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Akwɛyi e yo mbo te &lt;&lt;Umbana bɔkɔ akwu ɛnɛ mi mbala ɛmɛnɛ mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Akwɛyi e yese enzu umba o fula wu ma awu akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɛ mi mbala ɛmɛnɛ mi gba o ŋɔ le! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi gba akwu ɛnɛ mi mbala umɛnɛ mi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kwɔba Ungwu Ɔnɛgba U So Ewiri.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Omatiyu 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Oluku 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Ɔnu uwufo kpɔ, Ɔzhizɔsi e le mu enzu apula izɔma mu kenzu unga risu ingyi Ogalili. Riba ingyi enzu ɔ gba o bo, o fula wu ma. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, e fye mu kwoda a ŋɔma mu embyi tayi enzu ba ɔ ri mu kenzu unga embyi o she wu eyi. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />A zɔ mba apula gyɔɔ mu aba. A za mba te: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />&lt;&lt;La lu pwa! Ɔnɛgba uwufo a ka mba isomo mu utu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Tabɔkɔ e le mu eyi iyi ewiri itomo, iyifo i fu mu ɔgwuzɛ akwɛyi afyi ɔ wɔ o koyimo. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Iyifo i fu mu kizɛ ingyi ekyi. Kwuwongwu umbwuru u yi gyɔɔ mo awu, i wɔma iyayi efyefya bi. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ɔbulɛ ŋa tabɔkɔ ɔnu u le mu ilama, i shirima kwuwongu akpa yi i fyemo i ka mɛzhɛzhi mo. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Eyi iyifo i fu mu kizɛ ingyi awula. Awula i ma yi ma kpakyikpakyi nzhii ba i fa la imuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Eyi iyifo ba i fu mu ɛzhi iyesheshi akwɛyi i wɔma, i bulɔma akwɛyi i muma gyɔɔ; iyifo i muma izhi uwo ɛkpɛla, iyifo izhi uwo ɛkpɛrɛnyi, iyifo ba oderi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu e yi alu iyi ipwama, ba la pwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiya Ingyi Ki Shi Ɔzhizɔsi E Siso Mu Aba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Omatiyu 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Oluku 8.9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />kwuye ungwu enzu o kama akwɛyi i shi wu kɛɛkyi wu mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu wewo la wepo mbamba mbala wa mbwalu umbafo, akwɛyi o za wu te le shɔkɔ la lu mba aba ɛnyi ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Akwɛyi a za mba te, lunyi wa mbwalu, kwunvyeru ungwu irɛsu iyi oshi, Ukpo a wu yi ngwu ma-a. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kwudu ba, akwu mu aba gba mi so mbo iso le <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />kaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">&lt;&lt; &lt;iyi bɔkɔ o ma lala ba, lo zɔngɔ yi ma mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">iyi bɔkɔ o pwa ba lo zɔngɔ yi ma mo tete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">kwuwongu o bɔ ta mɛzhi akwɛyi Ukpo a gba yi kpa mba!&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lu Kwɔba Ɔnɛgba U So Ewiri Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Omatiyu 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Oluku 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo te &lt;&lt;Lu zɔngɔ kwoba kwɔlɛ ma mo? Ba lu wo te bɔkɔ lu zɔngɔ aba iyifo ɛlɛ ma? La lu ngbɛ alu ŋa nɛ kaa la lu pwa iluma iyi kwoba kwɔngu: <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Ɔnɛgba u somo e yi kyamate onzu u tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo tayi. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Enzu umbafo o yi kyamate eyi iyi bɔkɔ i fu mu ɔgwuzɛ tayi. Tabɔkɔ o pwa iso iyi Ukpo, mu kwɔtɔta kwɔngu onzu uwoyi e bo akwɛyi e to iso ɛnyi ma mu egbo iyi akɔ mba. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Umbafo o yi kyamate eyi iyi bɔkɔ i fu mu kizɛ ingyi ekyi tayi. O na iso iyi Ukpo efyefya la ɔnyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ɔbulɛ ŋa o do irima mo kwuwongu o nyama te lo ra la iso iyi Ukpo ngiri mo. kwuye ungwu o ma inyashi bwɛɛ kwuwongu iso iyi Ukpo imbwaluma, o gba kembo. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Umbafo kpɔ, o yi kyamate eyi iyi bɔkɔ i fu mu kizɛ ingyi awula tayi o pwa iso iyi Ukpo; <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ɔbulɛ egbo gidigidi iyi ɛnwu, mbala igyikpɔɔ kaa lo yi eduwo, mbala ekweyi iyi apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ i to mbo egbo mo akwɛyi iso iyi Ukpo i fya riyi mu akɔ mba kaa li shi mbo lo wo ɛduma iyeshi mo. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Umbafo ba o yi kyamate eyi iyi bɔkɔ i fu mu ɛzhi iyɔlu tayi. O pwa iso iyi Ukpo, o na yi ma, akwɛyi o wa la imuma iyeshi, iyifo i muma izhi uwekpela, iyifo uwɛkpɛrɛnyi, iyifo ba oderi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwɔba Ungwu Upitula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Oluku 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a ba mba kwoba ungufo kpɔ te, &lt;&lt;Onzu a bi upitula ɔyi akwɛyi e kpo wu kiya, nana e shi wu mu ubwu uwu kwugodo o? E fulo wu mu kiya mu kadu mo? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Tatayi iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ i nvyemo, Ukpo a ta yanduu mu kwudu memowu, iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ o koko yi mo, ba o wu yi ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi alu iyi pwama, ba la pwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛndu marimari mu iso iyi bɔkɔ lu pwa le lɛɛbi.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Moo omudu uwu ŋɔ rawu ŋɔ mondo awu, mawu gba o mondo ŋɔ le tete, uwu bɔkɔ a ka ele mo lala, o mondo ŋɔ mawu bi. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Moo onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi kiya, o gba o kyo wu ngyi mo kpɔ, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi ngyi mo ba, rikɛkyi ingyi e yi ngyi lala o na wu ngyi ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu Ibulɔma Iyi Ewiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Ɔzhizɔsi e kyo a za mba te &lt;&lt;Ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo i yi kyamate ɔnɛgba e to eyi fyafya mɛzhi tayi. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />La utu la ɔnu, shi e yi mu ondo, shi e yi la reyi, eyi ɛnyi i kpama akwɛyi i le mu ibulɔma, u wu ba e yitu iyi bɔkɔ i wo dɛɛ ba eyi i kpama akwɛyi i le mu ibulɔma mo. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Ɛzhi lɛyilɛyi gba i shi eyi i kpama akwɛyi i le mu ibulɔma nzhii ba i muma le. Anga gba i gwo la iwɔma le, akwɛyi reshi ri mbwalu akwɛyi eyi i wɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Kwuye ngwu eyi i kɔma, ee le mu ilɔma mu kworize kwɔngu akwu kwuye ngwu ilɔma .&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu Kwuyi Ungwu Omusita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31">Omatiyu 13.31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Oluku 13.18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe bɔkɔ ki masa ngyi mbala ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo , nana kwoba ungwu na bɔkɔ ki ba ungwu bɔkɔ kwu zɔ ɛsu irimo iyoshi? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />I yi kyamate kwuyi ungwu omusita ungwu kwu ka kɛɛkyi laa kwuyi ungwunanguna mu kwudu kwɔlɛ akwɛyi e so ngwu mo mɛzhi tayi. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Tetete, o so ngwu mo, kwu bulɔma kwu ka moshi akwɛyi kwu ka ɛwɛyi iyi utu mo lɛɛbi. Kwu bɔ ende iyɛku akwɛyi afyi o lo rigwu mu kwundu yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Mu aba ɛlɛ te gba Ɔzhizɔsi a ma mba mu iso iyi Ukpo izɔma le mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ o do yi izɔngɔma. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Kwuye ungwunanguna bɔkɔ e so iso mbala mba, e so mu aba. kwuye ungwu e yi kɛɛkyi wu mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu ba, a la mba aba ɛnyi ma lɛɛbi.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Kpa Kwokpo Ɛyi Akwɛyi Kwu Gbomo Ndii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Omatiyu 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Oluku 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Mu onoyo ɔnungawu, Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu te &lt;&lt;La ki sama so mu ɛsɛnyi iyi risu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Akwɛyi o lafya la riba ingyi enzu mbamba akwɛyi o fye mu kwoda mbala Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi o le mu luzɛ. Ada iyi embyi iyifo i yi mbala wu tete. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu luzɛ mu risu, akwɛyi kporo ba kwokpo ungwɔkwu kwu ngyi akwɛyi kwu shi embyi o le mu ifyemo mu kwoda nzhii ba i shi te kwoda lakwu dingbi mu embyi tayi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Kwuye kwɔngu ba Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mizhikembo iyi kwoda mu ondo ikpolomo iyawu, e fulo reshi mu gagyi. Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yimo la oga o ka o nyi wu eyimo akwɛyi o yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba i shi ŋɔ taka te kinzu ki ŋi tomo mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yimo a kpa kwokpo kwɔngu ɛyi akwɛyi a za la agba iyi embyi ɛnyi te, &lt;&lt;Gbomo! Ki wo akpa fo!&gt;&gt; Kwotota kwɔngu kwokpo kwu lafyima akwɛyi kizɛ ki gbo ndii.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Akwɛyi e yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu wiyi te? Lunyi lu du kwu idu lu fulo mo kpɔɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Izele mbala iyi i wo mbo mo gyɔɔ akwɛyi o le mu esu kwuyo iyomo te, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu uwe bɔkɔ kwokpo mbala agba iyi embyi lala i lo wu mo te?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Onzu Uwufo E Yi Ofya Umbu Ɛndu Iyira Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Mbu Mo<note caller="-" style="x" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Omatiyu 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Oluku 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o sa risu ma o ka mu ɛzhi iyi enzu umba Ogerasa <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a kalama mu kwoda, kɛlɛlɛ onzu ukpɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ e yi ofya umbu ɛndu iyira a wɔ mu agariwu e bo munyi wu. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Riyi ingyi i ŋɔma wu gba akwu mu agariwu le, onzu ukpukpɛnyi te e do wu i mama mu ɛyɛ mo; <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />o koko oo fu wu ɛyɛ mu alɛ mbala ewo, kwuyengwunanguna ba a zɛ ɛyɛ ɛlɛ ma akwɛyi a shɛkɛ etoshi ɛlɛ ma. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e do wu ikpama mɛzhi e yi mo. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Lutu lɔnu e yi mu agariwu mbala lɔwa aa wanu ba e kpolo ɛnwu wu ma iyɔkpɔ mu ekyi,<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Tabɔkɔ a ma Ɔzhizɔsi shaaru akwɛyi e renya e bo e kwumo mu idu wu. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Akwɛyi a wanu mu opwu uwɔkwu te, &lt;&lt;Ka ta ŋa te mbala mi, Ɔzhizɔsi Umɛ uwu Ukpo Edego ala? Vungɔma la Ukpo te ŋɔ lo mi inyashi mo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Kwuwongwu Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ɛndu iyira ɛlɛ, wɔma ka shi onzu ele!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyi ŋɔ o ya ŋa te?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">A gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyi mi o ya mi te Ɔlizhɔ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;moo ki yi riba .&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Akwɛyi a kpa Ɔzhizɔsi ɛshɛku iyɛkɔkɔ te la ramba ma mu ɛzhi ɛnyi mo.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Erusu ribariba o yi mu irimo memba iyi lɔwa mɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Akwɛyi eyo umbeyi umba bɔkɔ o yi mɛnwu iyi onzu awu o kpa Ɔzhizɔsi ɛshɛku te, &lt;&lt;Shi nzu kaa la ki fye mu erusu mbɔlɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a nya mba ma, ɛndu iyira ɛnyi ba i wɔma i ka i fye mu erusu. Erusu mbamba o renya o fye mu embyi akwɛyi embyi o ri mbo mo, o yi mate edubu epo te.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o bɔ eyi mu erusu awu o renya o ka mu kwuse mbala mu ese ikɛlɛkɛlɛ, o so mbo ɛlɛ, akwɛyi enzu o wɔ kwudu o bo ka lo ma kiya ungyi ki wo le. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o bo mba Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi o ma onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi eyombeyi awu, te e lo ekpayi mu ɛnwu marimari a ŋɔma mɔmɔ, egbo wu ba i bo mɛzhi; ɛlɛ i shi enzu mbamba kpɛkpɛ mba o wiyi. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o ma kiya ingyi ki wo onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi ɛndu iyira mbala erusu awu o so yi enzu umbafo tete. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Akwɛyi enzu mbamba o le mu Ɔzhizɔsi ɛshɛku ikpama te la lafya la ɛzhi mba.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu ifyemo mu kwoda, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi ofya umbu ɛndu iyira dɛɛ awu, a kpa Ɔzhizɔsi ɛshɛku te e rimo mbala wu. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a nya wu ma mo, akwɛyi a za wu te,&lt;&lt;Sheyimo mogba mba enzu ŋɔ ka so mbo ɛduma iyi igba yi kpa iyɛku iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo ŋɔ mbala eyembembyi ŋɔ iyi a ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Akwɛyi onzu ele a kama iya wu mu ɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ o ya yi te Odikapoli (iyi bɔkɔ ɔ lu yi tee Ese Uwo awu) e le mu ɛduma iyɛku iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e wo wu awu anu itama la enzu. Iso ɛlɛ i shi enzu bamba lɛɛbi o ya kenzu.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umokokpayi Uwu Ɔzhariyɔs Mbala Okokpayi Uwu A Pwu Okpayi Uwu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu kwoda bɔkɔ a gba a sa embyi mo, enzu riba o kpalɛlu munyi wu mu kenzu unga embyi. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhariyɔ onzu uwakɔ ukpɛnyi mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu e bo mɔmɔ, tabɔkɔ a ma Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi e kwumo mu idu wu, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />akwɛyi a kpa wu ɛshɛku iyɛkɔkɔ te, &lt;&lt;Umɛ mi okokpayi uwɛri a nda la ikpomo fo, shɔɔkɔ bo kaa pwa wu afyi kaa ofya wu lu bomo kaa le yi kwunyɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a nyama a kama mbala Ɔzhariyɔs.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:24">Enzu gyɔɔ o kama mbala wu ba o kpa wu ma fyifyi. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Okokpayi ukpɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ e yi ofya umbu ɛnzhi i fumo lɔri luwo la lopo e yɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Oko ele a ka mba walepu gyɔɔ ba o kyo wu inyashi mesu bi, e tutu kiya ungyi kwuwo wu mo ndii ba ofya wu u bomo mo. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />A pwa eza iyi Ɔzhizɔsi,akwɛyi e fye mu riba ingyi enzu mbamba a zɛ mu kembo a ka pwa wu afyi mu okpayi wu, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />kwuwongu a ka amasa te, &lt;&lt;Gba mi pwa afyi mu okpayi wu bi lala, ofya mi uu bomo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Tabɔkɔ a pwa wu afyi kɛlɛlɛ akwɛyi a ma mɛnwu wu te ofya umbwu ɛnzhi wu u bo moo.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yitu kɛlɛlɛ te ekpasu i wɔma mu ɛnwu wu. Akwɛyi e geleyi kalala mu riba ingyi enzu mbamba akwɛyi e yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Uwe bɔkɔ a pwafyi mu origa mi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ ma enzu te o lo ŋɔ kwukpo gyɔɔ te, &lt;Ŋɔ gbi yo kwuyo te uwe bɔkɔ a pwa mi afyi kpɔ?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e le mu iyesemo mu riba ngyɛngyi kaa la ma onzu uwu bɔkɔ a pwa wu afyi. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Okokpayi awu e yitu te ofya wu u bomo-o, e bo e kwumo mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi la ipulama mbala iyi, akwɛyi e so wu ongbulolo. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za wu te,&lt;&lt;Umɛ mi, ikwu idu lu fulo ŋɔ i sa ŋa ma-a, ofya ŋa u bomo-o so moloto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu iso isomo bɛnɛ, akwɛyi enzu umbafo o wɔ mu kwogba ungwu Ɔzhariyɔs, onzu uwakɔ mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu, o za wu te. &lt;&lt;Umɛ ŋɔ e kpomoo, uŋɔ ki wo u zɔ kiya mɛnwu fo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa mba ɛkwu mo, akwɛyi a za la u to keyi uwu udaba uwu Azhu te,&lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ki riyi mo, kwu idu lu fulo bi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ɔzhizɔsi a nyama te onzu uwunawuna le somo mbala wu mo , e to Opita, Ozhemisi mbala Ɔzhɔnu umanyi wu Ozhemisi a kpa lɛngwu. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o bo mu kwogba ungwu Ɔzhariyɔs u to keyi uwu udaba uwu Azhu awu, Ɔzhizɔsi e du enzu mu ikyakwokwo ibyima la ega ilomo gbɔrɔrɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Ɔzhizɔsi e fyemo akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ lu byi ikyakwokwo la ega ilomo le? Umɛ ele e kpomo mo e yi mondo bi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Akwɛyi o nyɔngɔ wu ma, moo o yitu te umɛ ele e kpo moo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Tabɔkɔ a wa mba kwudu lɛɛbi akwɛyi e to ada uwu umɛ mbala ɛnɛ uwu umɛ mbala Wavɔngɔkiya umba bɔkɔ o zɛ mbala wu o bo mɔmɔ awu, akwɛyi o fyemo mbaa bɔkɔ ukpɛzhi uwu umɛ ele a nɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Ɔzhizɔsi eyi umɛ ele mɔwu akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Talita kumi!&gt;&gt; (Iyi bɔkɔ o lu yi ma te, &lt;&lt;Umokokpayi mi za ŋa te yimo!&gt;&gt;). <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Umokokpayi ele (e yi lɔri luwo la lopo), e yimo kɛlɛlɛ akwɛyi e le mu luzɛ. Umba bɔkɔ o ma ɛlɛ le a kwamba kenzu iyama gyɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ta mba okpa ngiri te, onzu la pwa yi mo akwɛyi a za mba te la lu shi wu kiya kaa le ri.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">O Towo Ɔzhizɔsi Mo Mu Ɔnazarɛti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Omatiyu 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Oluku 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi e fulomo mɔmɔ a ka mu kwogba mba mu Ɔnazarɛti, Wavɔngɔkiya wu ba o kama mbala wu. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Tabɔkɔ eyi i lama mu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo, Ɔzhizɔsi e le mbo mu ɛzu izɔma mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama iyi Azhu, enzu gyɔɔ umba bɔkɔ o pwa iso wu o ya kenzu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">Enzu o yo kwuyo tee, Onzu ele a vɔngɔ ɛlɛ muna? Uwe bɔkɔ e shi wu ilukwu ɛlɛ bɔkɔ e wo apula iyi amɛ ɛlɛ le! <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ele akwu Okapita umanyi wu Ozhemisi, Ozhosesi, Ozhuda mbala Ɔsamɔ, ɛmɛ umba Omeri mo re? Ɛmanyi wu ekokpayi o ŋɔ mbala nzu le mo re? Akwɛyi o towo wu mo.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Anukenzu e yi inzumbɛku mu kwuse wu la mekeka iyi enzu wu la mu kwogba wu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Enzu bwɛɛ te gba a pwu mba afyi gba e bo mbo ofya ma mɔmɔ le, moo e wo ɛduma iyi amɛ gyɔɔ mɔmɔ mo. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />A kwa wu kenzu iyama bɔkɔ enzu wu o kwu idu lu fulo ma wu mo awu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lɔ Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Wu Wewo La Wepo Ma</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Omatiyu 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Oluku 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a fulama a ka mese mese mu ɛzu izɔma. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />A ya Wavɔngɔkiya wu wewo la wepo mbamba ma akwɛyi a lɔ mba ma wepo wepo, e shi bo ekpasu kaa lo ra la ɛndu iyira ma.<verse eid="MRK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />A za mba te: &lt;&lt;La lu za la apula mu luzɛ yi ndɔlɛ mo. La lu to Upi kɛɛkyi. La lu za la kiya ingyirimo nana kwolamba naa eduwo mu amɛ yi mo, la lu za la upi kɛɛkyi. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />La lu lo ekpoyata, la lu za la ɛriga ekpepo mo. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Kwogba ungwunanguna bɔkɔ o na yi, la lu ŋɔ mɔmɔ nzhii ba lu bu fulomo mu kwuse kwɔngu. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Kwuse ungwunaguna bɔkɔ o na yi mo ba o pwa iso yi mo, la lu bulɔ umburu umbu alɛ yi ma, kaa li za mba izɔgɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya o wɔ kwudu o ka mba anu itama te, enzu lo kwu ira ɔsu. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />O ra la ɛndu iyira ma mu ɛnwu iyi enzu riba riba ba o ngbɛ enzu anyi umba olifu mu ɛnwu gyɔɔ ba ofya mba u bomo.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukwu Undu Ɔzhɔnu U Wo Obatisima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Omatiyu 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Oluku 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ɔsu Ɛrɔdu ba a pwa iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu iwomo awu, enzu gyɔɔ ba o yitu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi oo. Enzu umbafo o yi mu isomo tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima gba e yimo mu kwuvɔ le, gba a fya ekpasu iyi bɔkɔ e wo apula iyi amɛ ɛlɛ te le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Enzu umbafo o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;A kwu Elazha.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Umbafo ba o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;A kwu anukenzu awa, kyamate Anukenzu umbekyi tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɛrɔdu a pwa iso iyi bɔkɔ enzu o yi mu isomo, akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ akwu Ɔzhɔnu uwu bɔkɔ mi kpolo wu kwoshi mo awu gba a gba e yimo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Moo Ɛrɔdu ele gba e shi te lo yi Ɔzhɔnu ma dɛɛ le, akwɛyi e shi te lo fu wu ɛyɛ kaa lo ta wu mugugyi le. Kwuwongwu e to Ɛrɔdiya oko uwu umanyi wu Ofilipu mo le gba e wo ɛlɛ le. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Moo Ɔzhɔnu e koko e so ɛrɔdu te, &lt;&lt; Ɛrama iyi Omosisi i nyama ka to oko uwu umɛnɛ ŋɔ mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Kwuwongwɔlɛ Ɛrɔdiya a ra la Ɔzhɔnu makɔ, akwɛyi a gyi te la ngbɛ wu ma ba a fya kapa mo, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Ɛrɔdu a riyi iyi Ɔzhɔnu ba a gyi te le wo wu iyira mo, kwuwongu e yitu te akwu onzu ototo ba a zɛ luzɛ ɔnyɔnyɛ. Kwuye ungwunanguna bɔkɔ a pwa iso iyi Ɔzhɔnu e yi egbo mɛzhi mo; tetete ba a gyi te la pwa iso iyi Ɔzhɔnu.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ɔnu ukpɛnyi, Ɛrɔdiya a fya kapa ma kaa la ngbɛ Ɔzhɔnu ma. Ɛrɔdu e wo odumudumu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu kwomba wu la ada umba reshi, la wa to keyi umba asozha mbala enzu umbakɔ umba Ogalili. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ umokokpayi uwu Ɛrɔdiya a wɔ kwudu ungwu eko, akwɛyi e komo i she la Ɛrɔdu mbala agboga wu gyɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:22">Ɔsu ɛrɔdu a za la umokokpayi awu te,&lt;&lt;Kiya ingyinangyina ungyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi za mi,mii shi ŋɔ ngyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Akwɛyi a vungɔma la umokokpayi awu te, &lt;&lt;Gba akwu i kama epo iyi ɛzhi mi gba ŋɔ nda le lala, mii shi ŋɔ ingyinangyina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Akwɛyi a wɔ kwudu a ka za la anyi wu tee,&lt;&lt;Kimbe bɔkɔ mii nda?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">A gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Nda kwoshi ungwu Ɔzhɔnu uwo obatisima.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Umokokpayi ele a gbama la ɛnya kɛlɛlɛ a ka mbaa Ɔsu, akwɛyi a za wu te: &lt;&lt;Mi gyi te ka shi mi kwoshi ungwu Ɔzhɔnu uwo obatisima mu kaatu kekelele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Egbo iyi Ɔsu i fomo gyɔɔ, ba a gyi te la nyi wu ma mo, kwuwongu ivungɔma wu mbala agboga umba bɔkɔ o yi mu odumudumu awu. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Akwɛyi ɔsu a lɔ odakari ɛnyi ma kɛlɛlɛ a za wu te, so kaa kpolo kwoshi ungwu Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima ma ka ka mi ngwu. Odakari awu a kama mu ugu ugyi, a ka e kpolo kwoshi ungwu Ɔzhɔnu ma, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />ba a gba la kwoshi ungwu Ɔzhɔnu mu kaatu e bo ngwu e shi ngwu umɛ okokpayi awu akwɛyi a ka ngwu la Ɛrɔdiya anyi wu. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Tabɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhɔnu o pwa ɛlɛ, o bo to ukpɛzhi wu ma o ka o pwu wu mo mu ogariwu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Shi Enzu Edubu Ɛlɔ Kiya Ingyirimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Omatiyu 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Oluku 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Ɔzhɔnu 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Wa zɛ ilɔ umba Ɔzhizɔsi o gbama o bo o kpalɛlu mu idu wu akwɛyi o zɛ wu ilɔ, mate bɔkɔ umba o wo ɛduma ba o zɔ enzu kiya. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Kwuye kwɔngu tabɔkɔ enzu gyɔɔ o kama o gbama kaa lo ma Ɔzhizɔsi awu, o fya kapa kaa lo ri kiya mo, akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Lunyi la lu bo mi mu riyi kpɛnyi kyoo, kaa ɛnwu li gbo yi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Akwɛyi o fye mu kwoda o ka mu riyi ingyi kɛrɛrɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Enzu gyɔɔ ba o ma mba kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o fulo mo awu, akwɛyi o wɔ mu ese ɛnyi lɛɛbi o renya malɛ o to keyi la mba o ka mɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a kalama mu kwoda a ma enzu guruguru, akwɛyi inyashi mba i wo wu mo, kwuwongu o yi kyamate ilɔ umba bɔkɔ o yi u gbomo mo tayi. Akwɛyi e le mbo mu kiya riba riba izɔma.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Kwuye kwɔlɛ ɔnu u bo-o, akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o bo munyi wu o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Kizɛ ngyɛlɛ ri yi fɔrɔ, ɔnu ba u bo-o. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Uŋɔ shi enzu mbɔlɛ kaa lo so mu ɛnu mbala ese iyi bɔkɔ i yi munɛ kaa lo ya kiya la ɛmba lo ri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Lunyi la lu shi mbo kiya kaa lo ri.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Umba o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Eduwo iyi rigbɛ ingyi onzu uwu ɛduma iyi evya ɛranda la kiya mɔsu gba ii domo le! La ki ngbɛ eduwo gyɔɔ tayi dɛɛ kaa ki ya kiya ingyirimo la ki shi mbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Eri iyi eburedi ɛvɔ bɔkɔ lu za yi? La lu so ka lu yese.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o ka o yese yi mo, o za wu te, &lt;&lt;Eri ɛlɔ mbala emu wepo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, lo shi enzu mbamba ka lo ŋɔma mu ɔsɛ uwu ewu ɔnwu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Akwɛyi enzu mbamba o kpala izhi oderi oderi umbafo ba uwo ɛkpɛlɔ uwo ɛkpɛlɔ ba o ŋɔma lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Ɔzhizɔsi e to eburedi ɛlɔ ɛnyi mbala emu wepo mbamba ma. Akwɛyi e yi reshe faa e yese moshi, a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi, a mu yi ma. Akwɛyi e shi yi Wavɔngɔkiya wu kaa lo ka yi enzu. Tee gba a ka emu wepo mbamba ma la enzu mbamba lɛɛbi le tete. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Kpɛkpɛ mba o ri ubu e do mbo mo. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Lubiri luwo la lopo undu ebwebwede iyi eburedi mbala emu iyi bɔkɔ o ri ishimo, gba Wavɔngɔkiya o kpala yi ɛlu le. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Anzɔnu umba bɔkɔ o ri le akwu enzu edubu ɛlɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɛma Mu Kadu Unga Embyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Omatiyu 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Ɔzhɔnu 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu te lo fye mu kwoda kɛlɛlɛ, kaa lo to keyi la wu lo sama lo so mu ɔbɛsayida, kaa uwu le shi enzu umba riba mbamba lo somo dɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Tabɔkɔ e wo mbo ungbo, akwɛyi a ka a yama mu kadu unga lɔwa mba Ukpo ilɛma.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ ɔnu u fyemo, kwoda kwu yi mu ekeka iyi embyi ee, Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yi kɛɛkyi wu mu ɛzhi bɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />A ma te Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yi mu ebirigo igbomo mbala kwoda ipɛma, kwuwongu kwokpo kwu shi mbo eyi mɛnwu. Mu eyifumo Ɔzhizɔsi a zɛma mu kadu unga embyi a ka munyi bo, akwɛyi e wo mate a pyika munyi bo te. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Tabɔkɔ o mate te e yi mu luzɛ mu kadu unga embyi, o mate naa akwu ubana lo akwɛyi o byi ikyakwokwo, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />moo tabɔkɔ lɛɛbi mba o ma wu awu, iyi i wo mbo mo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Akwɛyi E so mbo iso kɛlɛlɛ te, &lt;&lt;Imi gba mi ŋɔ le, la lu yidu la lu riyi mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Akwɛyi e fye mu kwoda mbala mba, ba kwokpo kwu gbo ndii. Umba o ya kenzu gyɔɔ, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />moo umba o zɔngɔ kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e shi enzu o ri awu ma mo, kwuwongu egbo mbo ikɔma.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Enzu Efya Ma Mu Ozhenesareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Omatiyu 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o sa embyi ma, o bo mu ɛzhi iyi Ɔgɛnɛsarɛ akwɛyi o ma kwoda ma mɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Enzu umba mɔmɔ o zɔngɔ Ɔzhizɔsi ma kɛlɛlɛ, tabɔkɔ a kalama mu kwoda awu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />O le mu enya irima o fye munamuna mu ɛzhi ɛnyi, o kwu enzu umba efya mu ɛkyɔ o ka mba munamuna mba bɔkɔ o pwa te e yi. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Munamuna mbaa bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e fye, la ese iyɛri, la ese iyɛku la ɛnu, o shi enzu umba efya mu okpulo. O kpa wu ɛshɛku tee kaa enzu umba ofya lo pwu afyi mu ɛtu iyi okpayi wu kaka, ba enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwu afyi mu okpayi wu le ofya mba u bomo.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛzɔ Iyi Umba Asɔkwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Omatiyu 15.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Afarisi mbala wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi umbafo o wɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o bo o kpala ɛlu mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />o ma ta bɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wu o ri kiya la ewo iyi &lt;&lt;ɛnyinyi,&gt;&gt; inyi gba akwu tee, ewo mbo iyi sɛsɛ mo kyamate ukwu uwu ɛdɔ mba u so. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Uzhi uwu Afarisi mbala umba Azhu lɛɛbi o shishi ewo mo sɛsɛ dɛ gba o ri kiya le, moo o rala ukwu uwu enzumbakɔ mba; <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Akwiyi gba o gbama mu rishi oo womo dɛ gba o ri kiya le. Umba o bɔ eyi mu ukwu uwu ɛdɔ mba gyɔɔ, apula i gbɔma mate ɛkɔpu, lu wu, ebuta, mbala egodo tayi.)<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Akwɛyi uzhi uwu Farisi mbala wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi o yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo tee,&lt;&lt;I wote bɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya ŋa o mbwalu ukwu uwɛdɔ uwu enzumbakɔ nzu mo bɔkɔ o ri kiya la ewo iyi bɔkɔ i yi,&lt;Sɛsɛ mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, lunyi wa mwangba mbɔlɛ; &lt;&lt;Anukenzu Azaya a zɔ riwɔ ɔnyɛ mu reshi yi, bɔkɔ a ka te lu kwu wamwangba:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">&lt;&lt; &lt;Enzu mbɔlɛ o shi mi inzumbɛku mu kenzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">idu mbo ba indama mbaa mi.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />O gbo mi oya uwu umbwa bi; kiya ingyi bɔkɔ umba o zɔ akwu ɛzɔ iyi onzu iyidɔɔ bi.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Lunyi lu lafya la ɔkpa uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a ta la onzu ba lu rala ukwu uwu umbete yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te:&lt;&lt;Lunyi lu yi amasa iyi bɔkɔ lu shi ɔkpa uwu Ukpo mɛmba ba lu mbwalu ukwu uwu umbete yi! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Moo Omosisi a zɔ te, &lt;Onzu le lo ete wu mbala anyi wu ma,&gt; ba, &lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e pe ete wu nana anyi wu ari, akwu mɛga ka lo ngbɛ wu ma.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Lunyi ba lu zɔ tee, gba onzu a za la ete wu nana anyi wu tee,&lt;Kiya ngyɛlɛ ŋɔ fya ngyi ma fo, moo akwu okoruba,&gt;(akwu rɛshi ingyi Ukpo), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />akwɛyi lu nyama te le wo kiya laa ete wu mbala anyi wu fo. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Tegba lu ngbɛ ɔkpa uwu Ukpo ɛdɔ ma le, akwɛyi lu zɔ ukwu uwɛdɔ yi, ba lu wo apula ɛlɛ te gyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Apula Iyi Bɔkɔ I Shi Onzu A Ŋɔ Sɛsɛ Mo Midu Iyi Ukpo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Omatiyu 15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gbala enzu gyɔɔ iyama kpɔ o bo munyi wu akwɛyi a zɔ tee,&lt;&lt;Uwewe la ngbɛ alu munyi mi, ka la pwa ɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ onzu e ri ki zhi wu &lt;ɛnyinyi&gt; umba Ukpo mo. Kiya ingyi ki wɔ mɛmi iyi onzu gba ki &lt;tutu wu mo mbaa Ukpo le.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi alu ba la pwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e fulomo a lafya la riba ngyɛngyi akwɛyi e fye mogba, Wavɔngɔkiya wu o bo o yo wu kwuyo meka iyi kwoba kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />E yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Lunyi tete lu zɔngɔ yi ma mo re?&gt;&gt; Lu yitu tee kiya ingyi bɔkɔ onzu e ri ki ka mu ubwu ki &lt;tutu wu mo mbaa Ukpo&gt; mo mo re? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Moo kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ onzu e ri ki fu mu egbo wu mo, ki fu mu ubwu wu akwɛyi ki wɔkwudu mu ɛnwu wu.&gt;&gt; (Ɔzhizɔsi bɔkɔ e so ɛlɛ awu, i zɔ te kiya ingyirimo ingyinangyina ki tutu onzu mo mbaa Ukpo mo&gt;&gt;.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />E siso a ka keyi tee:&lt;&lt;Kiya ungyi bɔkɔ ki wɔ mu ɛmi iyi onzu gba ki zhi wu &lt;ɛnyinyi&gt; le. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Moo mu akɔ iyi onzu gba amasa iyira ii wɔ le, amasa iyi iyama, ɛlɔ, onzu ingbɛma, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />kaya itomo,ekweyi, akɔ iyira, kwukyoro, i yi lovya mo, enzu ikyɛma, enzu i tutumo, i fulo ɛmba kadu mbala erondo. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i wɔ mɛmi iyi onzu akwɛyi &lt;I shi onzu e yi ɛnyinyi,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ikwidufulo Iyi Okokpayi Uwufo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Omatiyu 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya la mɔmɔ akwɛyi a ka mu kwuko ungwu Otaya. E fye mu kwogba ungufo ba a gyi te onzu ukpukpɛnyi le yitu mo. Tetete enzu o yitu te e yi mɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Okokpayi ukpɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ umɛ wu okokpayi e yi ɛndu iyira a pwa te Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mɔmɔ, kɛlɛlɛ e bo e kwumo mu idu wu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Okokpayi ele akwu onzu uwu Azhu mo, o mba wu mu kwuko ungwu Ofonisiya mu ɛzhi iyi Osiriya. A kpa Ɔzhizɔsi ɛshɛku ka la ra la ɛndu iyira ma li shi umɛ wu.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Rima kaa ɛmɛ lo ri keyi dɛ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;moo ishoshi te lo to kiya ingyirimo ingyi ɛmɛ, kaa lo fu la izu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Oko awu a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Tegba i yi le Ɔkwu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Izu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo mu idu iyi oteburu awu lala o ri ebwebwede iyi bɔkɔ i fumo mu ɛzhi awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Akwɛyi a za wu tee,&lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu opwu uwoshoshi uwu ŋɔ gba wu o le, sheyimo bi ŋa, ɛndu iyira ɛnyi i lafya la umɛ ŋɔ-ɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Oko ele a kama mogba akwɛyi e du tee, ɛndu iyira ɛnyi i lafya la umɛ wu aa, a nɔma mu kwugodo.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Onzu Usalu Ba E Tukenzu Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya la kwuko ungwu Otaya a zɛ mu Ɔsidɔ, nzhii ba a ka mu risu ingyi Ogalili mu ɛzhi iyi Odikapoli(Iluma yi iyi tee Ese Uwo), <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Enzu umba mɔmɔ o ka wu la onzu uwu bɔkɔ a pwa alu mo ba e siso ego mo, akwɛyi o kpa wu ɛshɛku te la pwa wu afyi ka le bo wu ofya ma.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Ɔzhizɔsi e to onzu ele mo a ka wu memba, akwɛyi e lo ɛfyi wu mu alu iyi onzu ele. A gba a la ɔtɛ akwɛyi a pwafyi mu ɔtinɛ uwu onzu ele. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yese moshi akwɛyi e fu ɛnyɔ faa akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Efata,&gt;&gt; inyi gba akwu tee,&lt;&lt;Wuma Gboo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Mu atata ɛnyi, alu iyi onzu awu i wuma, ɔtinɛ wu ba a vuvuma akwɛyi e siso kyoriri.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Ɔzhizɔsi e so enzu mbamba tee, iyi bɔkɔ uwu e wo le lo so yi la ɔzɛnzɛnyi te mo.Tabɔkɔ e so la enzu te lo so mo awu, tegba ba o yi mu isomo la enzu le. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Enzu o ya kenzu gyɔɔ ba o zɔ te. &lt;&lt;E wo iyinayina marimari,&gt;&gt; Wa salu lala e shi mbo te lo pwama, wa tukenzu ba o zɔ rɛnu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Fye Enzu Edubu Endo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Omatiyu 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Mu afyi ɛnyi, enzu gyɔɔ o gba o kpala ɛlu. Kiya ingyirimo ba ki yi mo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ya Wavɔngɔkiya wu ma o kpala ɛlu akwɛyi a za mba tee, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />&lt;&lt;Enzu mbɔlɛ o yi mbala mi afyi ela-a ba o yi kiya ingyirimo mo, eyembembyi mbo i wo mi mo. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Umbafo mbo o wɔ sharu, akwiyi gba mi zɔ tee lo sheyimo la lonzu, ewo i zɛ mba ma mu ɔgwuzɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu ba o gba wu opwu tee, i do te o fya kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ ki do enzu gyɔɔ te mo mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara munɛ mo. <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Lu yi eburodi ɛvɔ?&lt;&lt; O gba wu opwu tee,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">&lt;&lt;Erewo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za la enzu mbamba tee, lo ŋɔma mu ɛzhi, akwɛyi e to eburedi erewo ɛnyi ma, a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi a mu yi ma akwɛyi e shi yi Wavɔngɔkiya wu kaa lo ka enzu guruguru mbamba, akwɛyi o ka yi ma. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />O yi emu bwɛɛ tete; Ɔzhizɔsi a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi akwɛyi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, lo ka yi mba ma. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Enzu mbamba lɛɛbi o ri i do mbo mo. Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o kwu lobiri lu nyɔlɔma undu ebwebwede lorowo. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Anzɔnu mate edubu endo te gba o ri le. tabɔkɔ e shi enzu o kama, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ya mu kwoda mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o ka mu kwuko ungwu Odalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Afarisi O Gagyi Kiya Ingyi Amɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Omatiyu 16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Afarisi umbafo o bo o yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo te ka lo pwa wu ma. O za wu tee le shi mbo kɛzɔ u nga ka wɔ moshi. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />E fu ɛnyɔ faa akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;I wo te bɔkɔ enzu umba ɔyi ɔlɛ o gyi kɛzɔ te? Mi so yi ongbulolo te mii shi yi kɛzɔ ka kpɛnyɛnyi mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya la enzu mbamba e fyemo mu kwoda mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o sama o ka mu ɛsɛnyi.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otutu owuna Uwu Afarisi Mbala Uwu Ɛrɔdu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Omatiyu 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya umba Ɔzhizɔsi o kalakwuleyi o za la eburedi gyɔɔ mo, ba o za la kukpɛnyi mu kwoda. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛndu.&gt;&gt; La lu bɔ eyi kwudu kwuwongu otutu owuna uwu umba Afarisi mbala umba Ɛrɔdu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />O so mbala esu tee, &lt;&lt; Akwu kwuwogu bɔkɔ ki za la eburedi gyɔɔ mo le gba e so le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yitu iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ o yi mu isomo mbala esu, akwɛyi e yo mbo tee: &lt;&lt;Lu ma ɛbɛ mo kpɔ re na lu zɔngɔma mo ŋa bɔkɔ lu siso iyi eburedi le? Egbo yi i kɔ mu kiya inzɔngɔma te lee? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Lu ka la kwuleyi re? Lu yi eyi lu ma ɛbɛ mo?, Lu yi alu ba lu pwama mo? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ mi mu eburedi ɛlɔ la enzu edubu ɛlɔ awu, lu kwu inyɔlɔma iyi lubiri undu ebwebwede luvɔ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">&lt;&lt;O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Luwo la lopo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />&lt;&lt; Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ mi mu eburedi erewo awu kɔ,inyɔlɔma iyi lubiri undu ebwebwede luvɔ bɔkɔ lu shimo?&gt;&gt; O gba wu opwu tee &lt;&lt;Lorowo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, ifate la lu zɔngɔ yi ma ŋa moo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Ofya Umbu Upeyi Ma Mu Ɔbɛsayida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Ɔzhizɔsi mbala wa mbwalu wu o bo mu Ɔbɛsayida, enzu umba mɔmɔ o bo laa upeyi, akwɛyi o kpa wu ɛshɛku tee la pwa wu afyi. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yi upeyi awu mu kwuwo akwɛyi a wa wu kwudu mu kwuse. E kpo wu ɔtɛ mu eyi akwɛyi e fulo wu kwuwo, akwɛyi e yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ ma kimbe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Upeyi awu e yi eyi mo faa, akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Mi ma enzu, o yi kyamate ɛwɛyi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu luzɛ tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a pwa wu afyi mu eyi kpɔ. Akwɛyi ofya wu u bomo, a ya eyi wu ma akwɛyi a gba la ɛbɛ imama marimari. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, sheyimo mogba, &lt;&lt;Kwu fye mu ese ɛlɛ mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opita A Zɔ Tee Ɔzhizɔsi Gba Akwu Okrasi Le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Omatiyu 16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Oluku 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Kwuye ngwu Ɔzhizɔsi a zɛ mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o sheye mu kwuko ungwu Oseseriya Ofilipiya, e yo mbo kwuyo mu ɔgwuzɛ tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu o zɔ te mi kwu uwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o gba wu opwu tee,&lt;&lt;Umbafo o zɔ tee ŋɔ kwu Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima; umbafo ba o zɔ tee ŋɔ kwu Elazha; umbafo kpɔ o zɔ tee ŋɔ kwu anukenzu uwufo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi kɔ, lu zɔ tee mi kwu uwe?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Opita a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Okrasi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mbo mu kwɔlu a za mba tee, lo so ɔnzɛnzɛnyi iso i ya wu mo.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E So Iso Meka Iyi Inyashi Wu Mbala Lukwu Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Omatiyu 16.21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Oluku 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ɔzhizɔsi e le mu wa mbwalu wu isomo tee, o lo Umɛ uwu Onzu inyashi gyɔɔ. Enzu umbakɔ laa ebwoshi umbakɔ laa wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi o towo wu mo, o ngbɛ wu ma, ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwɔla aa gba la i yimo mu kwuvɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ɔzhizɔsi e siso ɛlɛ gedegede, akwɛyi Opita a ka wa mɛmba e le wu mu isomo tee le so iso ɛnyi fo.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e gele eyi e yese Wavɔngɔkiya wu, a kpa Opita ɛyi tee &lt;&lt;Onzu uwoyi, pyama ka she mi kizɛ!&gt;&gt; Egbo ŋɔ i zɛ kya mbala iyi Ukpo mo, i zɛ mbala iyi enzu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Akwɛyi a ya enzu mo guruguru mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu, akwɛyi a za mba tee: &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba onzu uwunawuna a gyi te la mbwalu mi, a lafya la iyi bɔkɔ egbo wu igyi , e to kwuwɛyi ngwu lukwu wu e fulo mu kito kaa la mbwalu mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Moo onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a gyi tee la sa kwunyɔ wu ma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, kwunyɔ wu kwu tomo mba Ukpo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to kwunyɔ wu a tamakwuwo mi mbala ilɔ iyesheshi mi, a sa kwunyɔ wu ma. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Kimbe bɔkɔ akwu kwule ungwu bɔkɔ onzu a fya, gba a kpala apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ ɛlu ba a fya kwunyɔ mba Ukpo mo? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Naa kimbe bɔkɔ onzu a ra ngyi a ŋanga mbala kwunyɔ wu? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Onzu gba e wo lovya mi mu ɔyi uwu kaya mbala ingbomo ɔlɛ, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Imi Umɛ uwu Onzu mi bi nyɔ la inzumbɛku iyi Ada mi mbala iyi alɔgbulɔ wa kɛrikɛri awu, mii wo lovya wu tete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le, enzu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o ri munɛ o kpomo dɛ ishi o ma irɛsu iyi Ukpo la ekpasu meka iyi enzu wu le mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Vindɔma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Omatiyu 17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Oluku 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Mizhikembo iyi afyi ɛrɛnyi, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e to Opita, mbala Ozhemisi mbala Ɔzhɔnu akwɛyi a ka mba mu kadu unga lowa lu wɔzhi, o ka o kɔ ŋɔma kɛɛkyi mba mɔmɔ. Mu eyi mbo akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a vindɔma. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Akwɛyi ɛriga wu akwu iruwu puratata i ka kiya ingyinangyina mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ma. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Kporo byi akwɛyi o ma Elazha mbala Omosisi te o wɔ o yi mu iso isomo mbala Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Akwɛyi Opita a za la Ɔzhizɔsi te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, ishoshi bɔkɔ ki yi munɛ le. Kinzu ki la ɛnu ela, kwukpɛnyi la ŋa, kwukpɛnyi la Omosisi kwukpɛnyi ba lakwu ungwu Elazha.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Opita e yitu iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e so mo, kwuwongu iyi i wo mbo mo gyɔɔ.)<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Akwɛyi kwɔmu kwu wɔ akwɛyi kwu koko mbo mo, akwɛyi opwu u wɔ mu kwɔmu kwɔngu u zɔ te: &lt;&lt;Ele akwu Umɛ mi uwu mi pwu idɛnyi wu. Lunyi la lu ngbɛ alu munyi wu!<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Kporo akwɛyi o gele eyi akwɛyi o ma ɔzɛnzɛnyi mba fo, Ɔzhizɔsi kɛɛki wu gba e yi mbala mba le ŋa.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu ikalama mu lowa, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e shi mbo okpa te lo za la uwewe kiya ingyi bɔkɔ umba o ma le mo, nzhii ba Umɛ uwu Onzu o yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ dɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya mbɔlɛ o ba ɛza ɛlɛ mbala uwewe mo, iyi bɔkɔ umba o le mu isomo mayi gba akwu meka iyi iluma iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ, tee, &lt;&lt;O gba la iyimo la kwunyɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Akwɛyi o yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;I wo te bɔkɔ wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi o ka te akwu mega te Elazha a nyɔ keyi dɛ?<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ee te gba i yi le, Elazha a nyɔ keyi ka la nɔngɔ iyinayina ma dɛ. Tetete, i wo la bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te, Umɛ uwu Onzu ee yidu mu inyashi imama iyɛku akwɛyi enzu ba o towo wu mo awu? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Imi ba mi za yi te, Elazha e bo-o, enzu ba o wo wu kiya ingyi egbo mbo i gyi byi, mate bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi o ka mu reshi wu tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Wa La Kwundu Ungwura Ma Mu Umɛshɛri Uwufo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Omatiyu 17.14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Oluku 9.37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o bo o du Wavɔngɔkiya umbafo mbamba, enzu guru o fula mba ma, wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi ba o yi mu kaambu irimo mbala mba. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />tabɔkɔ enzu lɛɛbi o ma Ɔzhizɔsi, kɛlɛlɛ akwɛyi o ya kenzu gyɔ akwɛyi o rɛnya o ko bwa wu ma.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Lu ri Kaambu mbala mba i se te ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Akwɛyi onzu uwufo meka iyi enzu umba riba mbamba e to opwu te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, mi ka ŋa la umɛ mi uwu e yi ɛnyɔ iyira ba e siso kego mo. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Kwuye ungwunaguna bɔkɔ ɛnyɔ iyira ɛlɛ i yi wu, i fya wu mɛzhi pwu, akwɛyi a wa la kwɔnzhɛ mu kenzu, akwɛyi e le mu ɛnyi ilama mesu akwɛyi i kpalama mesu tiriri. Imi mi ka wu la Wavɔngɔkiya ŋa te lo ra la eyo ɛnyɔ iyira ɛlɛ ma, umba ba o fɔma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Lunyi ɔyi uwu bɔkɔ lu yi ikwu idu lu fulo mo mbɔlɛ, &lt;&lt;Mi ŋɔ mbala yi ngbɛɛ ba kwuyengwuna? Imi mi yidu mbala yi nzhii ba kwuyengwuna&gt;&gt;? Akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;La lu ka mi la umɛshɛri ɔnzɔnu ele&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Akwɛyi o ka wu la umɛshɛri ɔnzɔnu ele. tabɔkɔ ɛndu iyira ɛlɛ i ma Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi i shi umɛ ele, e le mu ipulama iyɛkɔkɔ, akwɛyi a ta mɛzhi akwɛyi e le mu inzomo mɛzhi la kwɔnzhɛ mu kenzu.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo ete wu umɛ ele te, &lt;&lt;Umɛ ele e yi mu ofya mbɔlɛ ipuma ngbaa kwuyengwuna&gt;&gt;?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">A gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ngbaa mu imɛshɛri wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />&lt;&lt;ɛnyɔ iyira i koko i ta wu mu ɔyi naa mu embyi kaa la kwu ngbɛ wu ma. Akwiyi gba ŋɔ do kiya iwomo, shɔɔkɔ ma inyashi nzu kaa mbwa la umɛ ele ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, lu zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba ŋɔ do yi iwomo?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Onzu e do ingyinangyina iwomo gba e kwu idu fulo mu Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Kɛlɛlɛ akwɛyi ete wu umɛ awu e to opwu uwakwu te, &lt;&lt;Imi mi kwidufulo; shɔɔkɔ shi kaa ikwidufulo mi li kyomo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ma te enzu riba o yi mu ɛnya irima iyi ɔ nyɔ munyi wu, akwɛyi a kpa kwundu ungwura kwɔngu ɛyi te, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ kwundu ungwu kwu se enzu alu ma kwu gba kwu shi enzu o siso kego mo awu, mi za ŋa te, wɔma mu ɛnwu iyi umɛ ele, ki gba ki fye ma wu gbee fo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Kwundu ungwura kwɔlɛ kwu tara ikyakwokwo akwɛyi kwu shi umɛ ele a pulama iyɛkɔkɔ, akwɛyi kwu wɔma mu ɛnwu iyi umɛ ele. Umɛ ele a nɔ mɛzhi mate ukpɛzhi tayi, akwɛyi enzu o le mu isomo te, &lt;&lt;Umɛ ele e kpo-o.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yi umɛ ele mɔwu akwɛyi e yi wo faa akwɛyi umɛ ele e yimo a rima.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu kwogba ungufo, akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yo wu kwuyo kyokyokyo te, &lt;&lt;I wo te bɔkɔ kinzu ki fa lakwundu ungwura kwɔngu iwɔma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;A kwu mu Ukpo ilɛma kɛɛkyi gba kwundu kwɔlɛ te kwu wɔma mu ɛnwu iyi onzu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi A Gba E So Iso Kpɔ Mɛka Iyi Lukwu Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22">Omatiyu 17.22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Oluku 9.43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o lafya la riyi ngyɛngyi akwɛyi o zɛ mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili. Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gyi te onzu uwunawuna le yitu mba bɔkɔ umba o yi mo, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kwuwongu e yi mu Wavɔngɔkiya wu ɛzɔ izɔma. A za mba te, &lt;&lt;Ɔ ŋɔ ya kwoya ungwu Umɛ uwu Onzu la enzu, o ngbɛ wu ma, akwɛyi mizhikembo iyi afyi ela a gba la iyimo mu kwuvɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Umba ba o zɔngɔ iso wu ma mo, umba ba o wiyi iyi o yo wu kwuyo iyi iluma iyi iso ɛnyi.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwe Bɔkɔ A Ka?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Omatiyu 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Oluku 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya o ka mu Okapanawu. Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ e fyemo mogba, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Kaambu lu ri unga mbe mu ɔgwuzɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Umba ba o gba wu opwu mo, kwuwongu mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔ ŋɔ mu kaambu irimo te uwe meka mba bɔ a ka.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔma , akwɛyi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu te, &lt;&lt;Gba onzu a gyi te la ka le, akwu mega le to ɛwu te a ka kɛkyi le, la gba le yi kyamate umɛgba uwu enzu lɛɛbi tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Akwɛyi e to umɛshɛri e shi wu a rima meka mba, akwɛyi e yi wu a kpa midu, akwɛyi a za mba te, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo esheshi la umɛshɛri mate ele te kwuwongu ɛnyi mi, esheshi ɛnyi e wo mi; onzu uwu bɔ a na mi, akwu imi gba a na le mo, a na onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ mi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onzu Uwunawuna Uwu E Towo Nzu mo Mo Akwu Uwanzu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49">Oluku 9.49</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:50">50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu a za la Ɔzhizɔsi te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, ki ma onzu uwufo a ra la eyombeyi mo mu enzu mu ɛnyi ŋɔ, akwɛyi ki za wu te la lafyima kwuwongu e kyo mbala nzu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu nyi wu ma mo. Kwuwongwu gba onzu ee wo apula iyi amɛ mu ɛnyi mi, kɛlɛlɛ a gba e siso iyira mi mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Moo onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu ogewa nzu mo, onzu awu akwu uwanzu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Imi mi so yi ongbulolo, gba onzu e shi yi omudu uwu embyi kwuwongu lu kwu umba Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, onzu awu a fa la rigbɛ wu inama mo.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apula Iyi Bɔkɔ I Shi Onzu E Ngbomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Omatiyu 18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Oluku 17.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />&lt;&lt;Gba onzu e shi onzu ukpɛnyi meka iyi ɛmɛshɛri mbɔlɛ umba bɔkɔ o kwu idu lu fulo mami le te la tama, lo ma wu riko ingyɛkwu mu kwɔrɔ ka lo ta wu mu risu ishika. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Akwiyi gba kwuwo ŋɔ kwuu shi ŋɔ kaa ngbomo, kpolo ngwu mo. Ishoshi i ka le kaa fyemo la kwunyɔ mbaa Ukpo la kuwo kwukpɛnyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ bi fye mu ɔyi uwu bɔkɔ u nyima mo la ewo epo awu, <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />mbaa bɔkɔ ezhizhiri o kpomo mo, ɔyi ba u nyima mo. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Akwiyi gba kwɔlɛ ŋɔ kwuu shi ŋɔ kaa ngbomo, kpolo ngwu mo. Ishoshi i ka le kaa fye la kwunyɔ mbaa Ukpo la kwɔlɛ kwukpɛnyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ bi fye mu ɔyi uwu bɔkɔ uu nyima mo la alɛ epepo yi, <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />mbaa bɔkɔ ɛzhizhiri o kpomo mo, ɔyi ba u nyima mo. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Tetete, akwiyi gba kwuyi ŋɔ kwuu shi ŋɔ kaa ngbomo, wala ngwu ma. Ishoshi i ka le kaa fye la kwunyɔ mbaa Ukpo la kwuyi kwukpɛnyi bɔkɔ o bo ta ŋa mu ɔyi la eyi epepo yi, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />mbaa bɔkɔ egbongbo umba bɔkɔ o kwu mbo mo oo kpomo mo ɔyi ba uu nyima mo.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Moo onzu uwunawuna o wulu wu ma mu ɔyi mate bɔkɔ isabɔ o wulu yi ma mu otopwa tayi.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />&lt;&lt;Otopwa e sheshi, akwiyi gba otopwa a nyima fo, ŋɔɔ wo wu te bɔkɔ a gba aa nyima kpɔ? La lu yi kyamate otopwa tayi ka la lu ŋɔ moloto mbala enzu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Ɛzu Mɛka Iyi Oko Irama Mbaa Ɔnu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Omatiyu 19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Oluku 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya la riyi ngyɛngyi a ka mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya akwɛyi a sama a ka mu ɛsɛnyi iyi ɔkwu uwu Ɔzhɔda. Akwɛyi enzu riba o gyiri wu ma ma, akwɛyi e le mbo mu ɛzɔ izɔma mate bɔkɔ e koko e wo awu.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Akwɛyi Afarisi umbafo o bo munyi wu te kaa lo pwa wu ma. O yo wu kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Ɛrama iyi Omosisi i nyama kaa onzu la ra la oko wu mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ba Omosisi a ta yi okpa te la lu wo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />O gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Omosisi e shi Ɔnu ekpasu te la ka kwupu ungwu ikama mbala oko wu le shi wu akwɛyi a ra wu ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;A kwu kwuwongu ipwamo yi gba Omosisi a ka yi ɛrama ɛnyi le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo kwudu kwɔlɛ awu ba, &lt;E wo ɔnzɔnu mbala okokpayi.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />&lt;Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, ɔnzɔnu a lafya la ete wu mbala anyi wu , akwɛyi a kpamesu mbala oko wu, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />akwɛyi umba wepepo mbo akwu kyamate ɛnwu ikpɛnyi tayi.&gt; Umba akwu wepo fo, akwu kyamate onzu ukpɛnyi tayi ŋa. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a kpamba mesu, onzu la ka mba ma mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi, o fye mu kwogba ngwufo, akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yo wu kwuyo iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ e so awu. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Akwɛyi a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a ra la oko wu mo akwɛyi e to oko awa, kaya gba e yi mu itomo le ba e ngbomo la oko wu. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Gba oko uwu ɔnu a lafya la ɔnuwu akwɛyi a gba la ɔnu iyama, akwu kaya gba e yi mu itomo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Shi Ɛmɛshɛri Esheshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Omatiyu 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Oluku 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Enzu o yi mu ɛmɛshɛri ibomo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi ka le fulo mbo ewo mu reshi, Wavɔngɔkiya wu ba o nya mba ma mo. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma tayi, amba o wo wu mo, akwɛyi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu te, &lt;&lt;La lu lafya la ɛmɛshɛri ka lo bo munyi mi, la lu nyi mba ma mo, moo irɛsu iyi Ukpo akwiyi enzu mate ɛmɛshɛri mbɔlɛ te. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Imi mi so yi ongbulolo, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a na irɛsu iyi Ukpo mate umɛshɛri mo, onzu awu e fye mo mba Ukpo mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Akwɛyi e yi ɛmɛshɛri mbɔlɛ a kpa midu wu akwɛyi e fulo mbo ewo mu reshi akwɛyi e shi mbo esheshi.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔnzɔnu U Yi Kiya Ingyi Kuwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Omatiyu 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Oluku 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e ye la luzɛ wu, onzu uwufo a rɛnya e ke kwumo mu idu wu. A za wu tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya uwoshoshi, kimbe bɔkɔ mi wo ka la mi fya kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ ŋɔ ya mi te onzu uwoshoshi, moo Ukpo kɛɛki wu gba akwu onzu uwoshoshi le. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Lunyi lu yitu iyi ɛrama iyi Ukpo lo: &lt;Ki ngbɛ onzu mo, ki to kaya mo, ki wu ɛlɔ mo, ki to izɔgɔ iyi angba mo, ki wo onzu ɔrɔ mo, lomo la ada ŋa mbala ɛnɛ ŋɔ,&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Onzu ele a za la Ɔzhizɔsi te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, ɛrama ɛlɛ kpɛkpɛyi mi mbwalu yi ndii ngbaa te mi kwu umɛshɛri le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi a yese wu mu iyi idɛnyi akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Kiya kikpɛnyi ki sheŋɔmo. So ka ya kiya ingyi ŋɔ yi ngyi lɛɛbi ma ka ka ngyi la ayirewa, akwɛyi ŋɔɔ fya rigbɛ moshi. Mizhikembo iyi ŋɔ wo ɛlɛ, de ba bo ka mbwalu mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />tabɔkɔ onzu ele a pwa iso ɛlɛ, akwɛyi e tutu eyi mo. Akwɛyi a kama iyawu la ubugyi, kwuwongu e yi kwuwo gyɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yese Wavɔngɔkiya wu akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Ikɔma kaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi kiya ingyi kwuwo lo fye mu kwogba ungwu Ukpo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Iso wu ɛlɛ i shi Wavɔngɔkiya wu kenzu iyama. Ɔzhizɔsi a gba e so mbo iso kpɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛshɛri, ikɔma kaa enzu lo fye mu kwogba ungwu Ukpo! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />I yi fulele i ka le kaa Onyakurumi le fyemo mu ɔtu uwu keyi la ifyemo iyi onzu uwu e yi kiya ingyi kwuwo mu kwogba ungwu Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Tabɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wu o pwa iso ɛlɛ kenzu iyama mba ka ka le ŋa, akwɛyi o za lesu te, &lt;&lt;Uwe bɔkɔ e do te a fya isama kpɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yese mbo akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Mbaa onzu ɛlɛ te i kɔ ma, mbaa Ukpo ba i yi tayi mo; moo Ukpo e do ingyinangyina iwomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Opita a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Kinzu ki lafya la kiya ingyinangyina akwɛyi ki mbwalu ŋɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />&lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a lafya la kwogba wu naa ɛmanyi wu anzɔnu, naa, ɛmanyi wu ekokpayi naa anyi wu naa ete wu naa ɛmɛ wu mbala utu wu kwuwo mi mbala kwuwongu rɛnu ngyi Ukpo, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />bɔkɔ a fɔma la rigbɛ inama ingyi ki ka ingyi bɔkɔ o fya ngyi mu ɔyi ɔlɛ izhi oderi mo. A fya agba mbala ɛmɛnɛ anzɔnu mbala ɛmɛnɛ ekokpayi mbala umba ada mbala umba ɛnɛ mbala itu-a ma inyashi kuwo mi tete; akwɛyi a fya kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ mu ɔyi uwu u bwu nyɔ awu. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Enzu riba umba bɔkɔ o to keyi kekelele oo mbwa kembo, akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kembo ba o yi mu keyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Gba E So Iso Ungwɔla Mɛka Iyi Lukwu Wu Kpɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Omatiyu 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Oluku 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o le mu luzɛ o sheye mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e to keyi, Wavɔngɔkiya wu o ya kenzu, enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu mba iyi i wo mbo mo. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e to Wavɔngɔkiya wu kpɔ a ka mba mɛmba akwɛyi a so mbo kiya ingyi ki bi du wu. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />A za mba te, &lt;&lt;Kinzu ki sheye mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, Umɛ uwu Onzu o ra wu o shi ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Ukpo. Oo fu ombu uwu lukwu o lo wu akwɛyi o ra wu o shi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />oo wo wu ɛnɛ, oo kpo wu ɔtɛ, o kpa wu ikpa akwɛyi o ngbɛ wu ma. Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwola ba, aa gba la iyimo mu kwuvɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ozhemisi Mbala Ɔzhɔnu O Nda Kwoya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Omatiyu 20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Akwɛyi Ozhemisi mbala Ɔzhɔnu ɛmɛ umba Ozebedi, o bo munyi wu o za wu te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, shɔɔkɔ wo nzu kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ ki nda ŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe bɔkɔ lu gyi te la mi wo yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />O gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Shɔɔkɔ shi kaa ukpɛnyi nzu la ŋɔ mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi ŋɔ, uwufo ba la ŋɔ mu kwuwo ungwu ɔzu ŋɔ ɔnuwu ŋɔ bi ŋɔ mu kagyi unga inzumbɛku ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba za mba te, &lt;&lt;Lunyi lu yitu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu yi mu indama le mo. Lunyi lu do inyashi imama mbala mi? kyamate lu wo embyi kyaa mbala mi mu kagɔ kakpɛnyi nana lu do idu iyimo mu inyashi imama mbala mi, kyamate o wo nzu obatisima mu inyashi tayi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Umba ba o gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ki do yi iwomo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Lu wo embi mu ago ikpɛnyi mbala mi kego,o wo yi obatisima kyamate oo wo mi obatisma awu. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />iŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwungyi mi mbala ungwɔzu mi ba, mi shi le mo. Riyi ngyɛlɛ akwu ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a nɔngɔ la enzu umba bɔkɔ a ŋa mba le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Tabɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhizɔsi wewo umba o shimo awu o pwa iso ɛlɛ, o wo amba mbala Ozhemisi mbala Ɔzhɔnu. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ya mba ma lɛɛbi, akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Lu yitu te asu umba enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu umba Azhu mo, o zɔ mba idomo, akwɛyi enzu umbakwu mba ba o so mbo iyi bɔkɔ umba lo wo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Li yi tayi meka yi mo. Onzu uwu a gyi te lakwu onzu uwakwu mekeka yi de lakwu umɛgba yi, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />onzu uwu a gyi te lakwu uwu kwonze meka yi ba, mɛga aakwu unye yi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Moo Umɛ uwu Onzu e bo te lo gbo wu rinye mo, uwu gba e bo te le gbo rinye la enzu le kaa le shi kwunyɔ wu lakwu sa enzu gyɔɔ ma le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Obatimiyɔ Upeyi Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Omatiyu 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Oluku 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi, Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o ka mu Ozheriko. Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu mbala enzu riba riba o ŋɔ lafya la kwuse kwɔngu, akwɛyi upeyi uwufo uwu o ya wu te Obatimiyɔ (iluma iyi ɛnyi wu gba akwu, Umɛ uwu Ɔtimiyɔ) awu, a ŋɔma mu kenzu unga ɔgwuzɛ aa nda kwoya. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />tabɔkɔ a pwa te Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti gba e yi mu ikakama le, akwɛyi e le wo mu opwu itarama te, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi, Umɛ uwu Odevidi, ma eyembembyi mi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Enzu gyɔɔ o kpa wu ɛyi te la kpala kenzu wu mo! Upeyi ele ba a kpakpɛɛ mu opwu itarama bi te, &lt;&lt;Umɛ uwu Odevidi, ma eyembembyi mi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a rima akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;La lu za la onzu awu te le bo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Akwɛyi o ka o ko ya upeyi ele ma, o za wu te, &lt;&lt;Ki wiyi mo! Yimo ka rima! Ɔzhizɔsi e ye ŋɔ mu iyama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Akwɛyi upeyi ele e to origa wu pyo, akwɛyi e yimo efyefya, akwɛyi a ka mba Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi te la mi wo ŋɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Akwɛyi upeyi ele a gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, mi gyi te la mi ma ɛbɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Sheyimo, moo ofya ŋa u bomo-o kwuwongu ŋɔ kwu idu fulo.&gt;&gt; Kɛlɛlɛ akwɛyi upeyi ele e le mu ɛbɛ imama , ba e le mu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma mu ɔguzɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Fye Mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Omatiyu 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Oluku 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Ɔzhɔnu 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o bo kɛlɛ mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, mbala ese iyi Ɔbɛtifagi mbala Ɔbɛtani mbaa odudu uwu Olifu, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wu ma wepo, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu so mu kwuse ungwu bɔkɔ kwu yi mu keyi yi awu, ta bɔkɔ lu yi mu ifyemo mu kwuse kwɔngu, lu ma umɛ uwu ɔzɛki te o lo wu uri o ma wu ma mu kwuwɛyi, uwu bɔkɔ onzu a da ya mawu dɛɛ mo. La lu vuvu wu ma, ka la lu ka mi munɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Gba onzu e yo yi kwuyo te, &lt;Kimbe ki wo ba luu vuvu wu ma?&gt; La lu za wu te Ɔkwu, e yi ugɔ wu, a ngbɛ kwuye mo, aa gba wu ma kekelele. <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wepo mbɔlɛ o ka mɔmɔ akwɛyi o du umɛ uwu ɔzɛki te o lo wu uri mu kwudu mbaa kenzugwu unga kwogba. tabɔkɔ o yi mu ɔzɛki awu ivuvuma, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />akwɛyi enzu umbafo umba o rima mɔmɔ, o yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ luu vuvu umɛ uwu ɔzɛki ele ma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />O gba mba opwu mate bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a lɔ mba awu, akwɛyi enzu mbamba o shibobi o ka la umɛ uwu ɔzɛki ele ma. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wepo mbɔlɛ o to umɛ uwu ɔzɛki ele o ka wu la Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi o fulo ekpayi mba mu kadu unga ɔzɛki akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ya mawu. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Enzu guruguru o fu ekpayi mba mɛzhi, umbafo ba o bɛ epu iyi bɔkɔ o bɛ mu ɔsɛ akwɛyi o fu mu ɔgwuzɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu keyi mbala umba bɔkɔ o yi mizhikembo o le wu mu ɛnyitomo ɔ zɔ te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">&lt;&lt;Osana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">&lt;&lt;Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e bo mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />&lt;&lt;Ɔnyɛ akwu ɛsu irimo iyi ete nzu Odevidi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu inyɔma!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">&lt;&lt;Iduma akwiyi Ukpo moshi&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ akwɛyi a ka mu ɔtɛpu. tabɔkɔ e yese ingyinangyina mɔmɔ, ba a ma te ɔnu u bo-o, akwɛyi uwu mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu wewo la wepo mbamba o ka mu Ɔbɛtani.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ta Uwɛyi Uwu Oboriyo Kenzu Unga Ira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18">Omatiyu 21.18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Eyi ilama, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o lafya la kwuse ungwu Ɔbɛtani, akwɛyi lonzu lu wo wu mo. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />E yi eyefaa akwɛyi a ma uwɛyi uwu oboriyo uwu u kpo epu biri mu keyi taayi, akwɛyi e turu a gba wu te igboshimo e du wu la imuma. Tabɔkɔ a ka kɛlɛ mu idu wu, a ma wu te u kpo epu byi, moo u muma mo kwuwongu akwu kwuyengwu imuma ngwu mo. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Akwɛyi a za la uwɛyi awu te, &lt;&lt;Onzu a gba e ri imuma iya ŋa gbee fo.&gt;&gt; Iyi bɔkɔ e so le, i fu Wavɔngɔkiya wu mu alu.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ka Mu Ɔtɛpu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Omatiyu 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Oluku 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Ɔzhɔnu 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Tabɔkɔ o fyemo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ka mu okepe uwu ɔtɛpu, akwɛyi e le mu enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu rishi iyama mɔmɔ irama. Eteburu mbala abɛ iyi iŋɔma iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o ŋanga eduwo mbala umba bɔkɔ o ya atatabiri ma awu e fulo yi pɛndɛ pɛndɛ, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Ɔzhizɔsi a nyama kaa enzu umba o ga la ewulo awu lo zɛ mu ekepe iyi ɔtɛpu awu mo. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Akwɛyi e le mbo mu ɛzu izɔma, a za mba te, &lt;&lt;O ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">&lt;&lt;&lt;Ɔtɛpu mi akwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:17">Ugu uwu bɔkɔ enzu lɛɛbi o lɛ Ukpo mawu&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 11:17">Lunyi ba lu wo ngwu mate kwofyo ungwu awɛlɔ tayi. <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wa zɔ ɛzu iyi ɛrama iyi Omosisi o pwa ɛlɛ, akwɛyi o le mu ɔgwuzɛ igagyima kaa lo ngbɛ wu ma, moo o wiyi wu, kwuwongu enzu lɛɛbi izele i wo mbo mo kwuwongu ɛzɔ wu. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Tabɔkɔ ɔnu u bomo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o lafya la kwuse kwɔngu.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwɛyi Uwu Oboriyo U Shirima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Omatiyu 21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yi mu pikama mu eyi i lama mukwoto, akwɛyi o ma uwɛyi uwu oboriyo ɔlɛ te u shirima nzhii ba mu akpa. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Akwɛyi Opita e lolo, akwɛyi a za la Ɔzhizɔsi te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, yese! Uwɛyi uwu oboriyo uwu ŋɔ ta wu kenzu ele, u shirima-a!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;La lu kwu idu fulo mu Ukpo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />&lt;&lt;Imi mi so yi ongbulolo te, onzu uwunawuna uwu a za la kwoki kwɔlɛ te, &lt;Ngbɛbwu ka so ka ta mu risu, akwiyi gba egbo iyi onzu awu i ka epo mo, uwu ba e kwu idu lu fulo te tayi gba ii wo le, Ukpo ee wo wu yi tayi. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Kwuwongwɔlɛ Imi mi so yi te mɛɛ, akwiyi gba lu nda Ukpo kiya inginangyina, la lu shi egbo te luu fya ngyi ma, akwɛyi Ukpo ba ee shi yi ngyi. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Tatayi, gba lu lɛ Ukpo kwuye ngwunangwuna, gba lu ra la amba umba onzu, la lu gba yi lu kpa wu, kaa ete yi uwoshi la gba la ingbomo yi la kpa yi tete. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Akwiyi gba lu gba la ingbomo iyi enzu lu kpa mba mo, tete gba ete yi uwoshi a gba la ingbomo yi aa kpa yi mo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enzu Umbakɔ Umba Azhu O Yo Ɔzhizɔsi Te Uwe Bɔkɔ E Shi Wu Ɛkpasu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Omatiyu 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Oluku 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o gba o ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu luzɛ mɛmi iyi Ɔtɛpu, akwɛyi ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi, ikyo mbala enzu umbakɔ umba Azhu, o bo o du wu. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Akwɛyi o yo wu te, &lt;&lt;So nzu, mu idomo iyi uwe bɔkɔ ŋɔ wo ɛlɛ?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Uwe bɔkɔ e shi ŋɔ ekpasu te wo ɛlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu te &lt;&lt;Imi tete mi yo yi kwuyo kwukpɛnyi: Gba lu gba mi opwu, Imi ba mi so yi mba mi fya idomo iyi apula ɛlɛ iwomo. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />La lu so mi! Obatisima uwu Ɔzhɔnu e ngyi mu na? E ngyi moshi naa e ngyi mba enzu ŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Akwɛyi enzu mbɔlɛ o ta amasa mbala esu te, &lt;&lt;Gba ki za wu te &lt;E ngyi moshi,&gt; ee yo nzu te &lt;Kimbe ki shi lu nyama la iso wu mo?&gt; <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ishi gba ki zɔ te, &lt;E ngyi mbaa enzu kɔ ...&gt;&gt;&gt; (O wiyi iyi enzu, moo enzu lɛɛbi ɔ nyama te Ɔzhɔnu akwu anukenzu uwu Ukpo ureyi.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Kwuwo kwɔngu, ɔ gba Ɔzhizɔsi opwu te &lt;&lt; Ki yitu mo.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Imi tete mi zɔ yi mbaa mi fya idomo iyi apula ɛlɛ iwomo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba Ungwu Asukpo Mu Utu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Omatiyu 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Oluku 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e le mbo mu kwoba kwɔlɛ ibama te: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo a gba utu uwu ekyikyi-iyɛvyi akwɛyi, a wɛwu ma mu ɔbɛ, a vu kizɛ ingyi bɔkɔ oo tu imuma iyi uwɛyi akwɛyi a la kwɔla ungwu onzu wu igbomo, akwɛyi a ra wu e shi asukpo umbafo akwɛyi a kama iyawu mu luzɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ imuma i do ibɛma-a akwɛyi a lɔ umɛgba wu ukpɛnyi te le so mbaa asukpo mbɔlɛ kaa la na ogbo wu la ka wu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Asukpo mbɔlɛ ba o yi umɛgba wu ele mo, o kpa wu ɛmwu, akwɛyi o ra wu ma la ewo iyidɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Ada uwu utu awu a gba a lɔ umɛgba uwufo kpɔ, uwu tete o kpa wu apula mu reshi, o lo wu lovya. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Ada uwu utu awu a gba a lɔ umɛgba uwufo kpɔ, ele o ngbɛ wu ma ŋa. Ada uwu utu ele a lɔ enzu ma gyɔɔ, akwɛyi asukpo mbɔlɛ o byi mba ɛmu, o ngbɛ umbafo mba ma. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Ada uwu utu i she wu onzu ukpɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ a lɔ, gba akwu umɛ wu uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi wu. Imbwama yi, akwɛyi ada uwu utu ele a lɔ umɛ wu munyi mba. A zɔ te, &lt;Enzu mbɔlɛ o lo umɛ mi ma.&gt; <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ umɛ uwu ada uwu utu ele e bomo, akwɛyi asukpo mbɔlɛ o le mesu iso isomo te &lt;Ele gba akwu u ri ogu uwu ada uwu utu le. Bo kaa la ki ngbɛ wu ma kaa utu lu ŋa nzu. <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Akwɛyi o yi wu mo, akwɛyi o ngbɛ wu ma akwɛyi o wa la ukpɛzhi wu kwudu mu utu ɔwu. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />&lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo te,&lt;&lt; Mu imama yi, ada uwu utu ɔwu ee wo te? Ada uwu utu ele aa gbama akwɛyi a ngbɛ asukpo mbɔlɛ ma, akwɛyi a ra la utu ɔwu ee shi wu enzu mbawa. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Lu du wa yi dɛ mo re mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">&lt;Kwoki ungwu ɔla ungwu bɔkɔ wa mbo ugu o towo ngwu mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">gba ku gba ku ra la ugu le,<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />ɛlɛ akwu iwomo iyi Ɔkwu, kinzu ba akwa nzu kenzu iyama.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Akwɛyi ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala enzu umbakɔ bɔkɔ o pwa kwoba kwɔlɛ, o gagyi ɔgwuzɛ te lo yi wu mo, kwuwongu o dama te iso ɛlɛ e so mbo, iyi ba i wo mbo mo kwuwongu o wiyi iyi riba ingyi enzu, akwɛyi o lu wu afyima o kama iyamba.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwuyo Meka Iyi Oba Uwɛzhi Ishimo Laa Osiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Omatiyu 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Oluku 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi, enzu umbakɔ umba Azhu o lɔ Afarisi umbafo mbala wa mbwalu Ɛrɔdu ma mba Ɔzhizɔsi. kaa lo kpa wu kwoda mba iso iyi e so. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Akwɛyi o bo munyi wu o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, ki yitu te ŋɔ kwu onzu ongbulolo, enzu o do ŋɔ egbo iŋagama mo, uŋɔ ŋɔ loshi la onzu kwuwongu kwunzu wu mo, uŋɔ ba ŋɔ zɔ ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo mu ongbulolo. Ɛrama nzu i nya nzu ma te la ki shi oba uwɛzhi laa Osiza naa i nya nzu ma mo ŋa? I sheshi te la ki shi naa i sheshi mo ŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yitu iyi kwukyoro mbo akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ lu gyi te la lu kpa mi kwuda? La lu ka mi la kwokobo kaa la mi ma ngwu. <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Akwɛyi o ka wu la kwokobo kwukpɛnyi, akwɛyi e yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Ureyi ɔlɛ akwu uwu uwe? Ɛnyi ɛlɛ kɔ, akwiyi we?&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi o gba wu opwu te &lt;&lt;Ureyi ɔlɛ mbala ɛnyi ɛlɛ akwiyi Osiza.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Kiya ngyi Osiza, lo shi ngyi Osiza, ngyi Ukpo ba, lo shi ngyi Ukpo.&gt;&gt; tabɔkɔ o pwa ɛlɛ, izele i yi mbo mo.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwuyo Mɛka Iyi Iyimo Mu Kwuvɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Omatiyu 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Oluku 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi akwɛyi, Asadusi umbafo umba bɔkɔ o zɔ te iyimo mu kwuvɔ i yi mo, o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi la kwuyo. <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />O zɔ te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Omosisi a ka ɛrama e shi nzu te, gba umanyi uwu onzu e kpomo e shi oko, oko awu ba e yi ɛmɛ mo, umanyi wu e to oko awu ma mɛga kaa le yi ɛdɔ la umanyi wu uwu bɔkɔ e kpomo awu. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Ɛmɛnɛ umbafo werewo o yi mɔmɔ. Uwu kwonze e to oko akwɛyi e kpomo oko ele ba a mba wu umɛ dɛ mo. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Umanyi wu uwopo e to oko awu, e kpomo tete e shi umɛ mo, inyinyi gba i wo umanyi wu uwola le. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Tayi gba i wo ɛmɛnɛ werewo mbɔlɛ le lɛɛbi. Mu imbwama yi, oko ele e kpomo tete. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Ɔnu wu iyimo mu kwuvɔ, uwe mu ɛmɛnɛ werewo mbɔlɛ akwu ɔnu uwu oko ele, moo lɛɛbi mba o to oko ele?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Luu kyoro ɛyi ma kwuwongu lu yi kwokpo ungwu Ukpo mbala ekpasu wu mo. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ɔnu wu iyimo mu kwuvɔ, enzu o to eko mo ba o ya anu mo, enzu o yi kyamate alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo moshi tayi. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Mekeka iyi iso iyi igba la iyimo mu kwuvɔ, lu du wa yi mu kwupu ungwu bɔkɔ Omosisi a ka dɛ mo re, mu ɛza iyi ɛzhi ingbarara ipwumo, bɔkɔ Ukpo a za la Omosisi te, &lt;Imi gba mi kwu Ukpo uwu Aburamu, Ukpo uwu Aziki mbala Ukpo uwu Ɔzhɛkɔbu le&gt; mo re? <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Uwu akwu Ukpo uwu ɛkpɛzhi mo, akwu Ukpo uwu enzu mba reyi. Lunyi lu ngbomo gyɔɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛrama Iyi I Ka Le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Omatiyu 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Oluku 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Ukpɛnyi meka iyi enzu wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi e yi mɔmɔ mu alu ingbɛma mu kaambu unga bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Asadusi o yi mi rimo. tabɔkɔ a dama te Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu marimari, akwɛyi e yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo tee: &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, ɛrɛma iyina bɔkɔ ika?&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ɛrama iyi ika gba akwu te, &lt;La lu ngbɛ alu lunyi enzu umba Izirɛ, Ukpo Ɔkwu nzu akwu ukpɛnyi. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />La lu pwu idɛnyi iyi Ukpo Ɔkwu yi mu akɔ, mbala idu yi lɛɛbi, mbala egbo yi mbala ekpasu yi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ɛrama iyopo iyi ika gba akwu tee, &lt;Pwu idɛnyi iyi onzu u nɔ kpa ŋa mate ɛŋɔ tayi.&gt; Ɛrama iyi i ka epo ɛlɛ ma iyi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />U zɔ ɛrama awu a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, ŋɔ gba opwu marimari&gt;&gt; Ŋɔ so ongbulolo bɔkɔ ŋɔ zɔ te Ukpo akwu ukpɛnyi awu, moo Ukpo awa e yi mo. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Idɛnyi ipwumo iyi Ukpo mu idu ŋɔ, la egbo ŋɔ lɛɛbi la ekpasu, ka gba pwu idɛnyi iyi onzu u nɔ kpa ŋa kyamate ɛŋɔ te, ɛrama epo ɛlɛ i ka rɛshi ingyi ipwumo mbala isabɔ iwomo ma.<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma te onzu ele a gba opwu mu ilukwu, akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ ndama mbala Irɛsu iyi Ukpo fo&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ onzu uwu e do tee e yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo e yi fo.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwuyo Mɛka Iyi Okrasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Omatiyu 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Oluku 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu enzu ɛzu izɔma mu odida uwu ɔtɛpu, akwɛyi e yo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;I wo te bɔkɔ wa zɔ ɛrama o zɔ te Okrasi akwu umɛ uwu Odevidi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Odevidi mafyi wu e siso mu ekpasu iyi Kwundu Ɔkɛrikɛri a zɔ te,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">&lt;Ɔkwu a za la Ɔkwu mi te:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">&lt;&lt;Ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwungyi mi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">kaa la mi shi ŋɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">kaa ri agewa ŋa ma lɛɛbi dɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Odevidi mafyiwu lala a ya wu tee &lt;Ɔkwu;&gt; i wo te ba Okrasi akwu umɛ uwu Odevidi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="ms" vid="MRK 12:37">Ɔzhizɔsi E Yi Enzu Mu Alu Mɛka Iyi Wazɔ Ɛrama Iyi Omosisi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Omatiyu 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Oluku 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Riba ingyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwa iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi ɛlɛ ɔ mwɔnyɛ gyɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Mu ɛzu izɔma wu, Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu wo bɛtɛ mbala enzu wa zɔ ɛrama. O gyi ifulama la ɛriga iyɛku, o gyi te enzu lo gbɛlɛ mba ɛnyi mu rishi. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />o gyi kizɛ ingyi iŋɔma ingyeshi mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpala iyi Azhu, mbala riyi ingyi inzumbɛku mbaa odumudumu iwomo. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />O na eko wakpanuma apula mbala agba mba ma, o to kwuye gbulɔlɔ mu Ukpo ilɛma kaa enzu lo ma mba. Enzu mbɔlɛ o ma wɔnu oo ka uwewe ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oko Ukpɔnuma E Wo Rɛshi Laa Ukpo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Oluku 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔma e sheyi mba kakyɔ unga bɔkɔ o ta rɛshi la Ukpo, akwɛyi a ma enzu te o yi mu eduwo itama mu kakyɔ unga ɔtɛpu. Enzu gyɔɔ umba bɔkɔ o yi kwuwo o ta eduwo iyɛku mu kakyɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Akwɛyi oko ukpɔnuma ɔyirewa awu ba e bo a ta ekobo epo.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu te lo bo kɛlɛ, akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le, oko ukpɔnuma ɔyirewa ele a ta kiya ingyi ki ka ingyi uwewe mo mu kakyɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Kwuwongwu enzu mbɔlɛ lɛɛbi o to mu meka iyi kiya mba kɛ gyɔɔ gba o shi le; oko ele ba e to meka iyi kiya wu lɛɛbi gba e shi ngyi le ndii, ikyo mbala eduwo iyi i fa te la ya ewiri ma yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E So Iso Mɛka Iyi Ishirimo Iyi Ɔtɛpu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1">Omatiyu 24.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Oluku 21.5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya la ɔtɛpu, akwɛyi uvɔngɔkiya wu ukpɛnyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya yese! Ekyi iyɛku mbala igwu iyesheshi ɛlɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te. &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ ma igwu iyesheshi ɛlɛ?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;O lafya la kwoki kwukpupkɛnyi te kwu fulo mu kadu ungufo mo; Lɛɛbi yi o fu yi mɛzhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ovyo Mbala Inyashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Omatiyu 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Oluku 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Tabɔkɔ a ŋɔma mu Lɔwa undu Ɔlifu undu lu shi eyi mu ɔtɛpu, akwɛyi Opita, Ozhemisi, Ɔzhɔnu mbala Anduru o bo munyi wu wɛrɛrɛ, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />o yo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;So nzu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ɛlɛ lɛɛbi ii bi wo? Kimbe ba akwu lɔzɔ undu lu zɔ te ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i wo mɛga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu a za mba te: &lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛndu kaa onzu ukpukpɛnyi le kyoro yi mo mo. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Enzu gyɔɔ o nyɔ mu ɛnyi mi, o zɔ te, &lt;I mi gba mi kwu Okrasi le,&gt; akwɛyi o kyoro enzu mo gyɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Kwuye ungwu lu pwa eza iyi ewa mbala kwɔdu ungwu ewa, la lu wiyi mo, moo apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i wo mega, ibomo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ ba i di bo mo bɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Ekeshi oo wala esu la ewa, kwuse ungufo kwu wa la ungufo la ewa. Ɛzhi inyagiri mu kizɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ mbala lonzu iyama. Apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i yi kyamate kambu iyemo bɛnɛ iyi ɛnyi iyimo iyi kwomba tayi.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />&lt;&lt;Lunyi la lu rima ngiri, moo o kwu yi o lo wa to keyi mɔwu kaa lo kpa yi ikpa mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu. Kwuwo mi luu rima midu iyi agomina mbala asu, akwɛyi luu za mba rɛnu mi. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Akwɛyi ilɔ iyesheshi ɛlɛ, akwu mega o ta yi anu munamuna la enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi keyi dɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o yi yi mo akwɛyi o bo te oo fu yi mu ugu, la lu wo idu kpu iyi kiya ingyi lu bu so midu mbo mo. Lunyi ba la lu so iso iyinaiyina iyi bɔkɔ o shi yi te la lu so mu kwuye kwɔngu mo, moo akwu lunyi gba lu yi mu iso ɛnyi isomo le mo, Kwundu uwu Ukpo gba e yi mu iso isomo ma yi le.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />&lt;&lt;Umɛnɛ e to umanyi wu a yama kaa lo ngbɛ wu ma, ada tete e wo mbala umɛ wu tayi. Ɛmɛ o sele umba ete mbo mbala umba anyi mba eyi akwɛyi o ngbɛ mba ma. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Enzu lɛɛbi o wo anya yi kwuwo mi, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a rima ngiri nzhii ba imbwama, gba Ukpo a sa wu ma le.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Inyashi Iyi Bɔkɔ I Lo Iyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Omatiyu 24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Oluku 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />&lt;&lt;Gba lu ma &lt;Apula iyi kashi mbala iyira&gt; iyi bɔkɔ i rima mbaa bɔkɔ i fate li rima mo,&gt;&gt; de ba onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu ɛzu ɛlɛ iwama la zɔngɔ yi ma, akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Ozhudiya awu ba lo renya lo so mu lɔwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi moshi uwu kɛnu ba la kalama naa le fye mogba te e to kiya kikpikpɛnyi fo. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Onzu uwu e yi mu utu, le so mogba te le to ɔmu wu mo. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Afyi ɛnyi aakwu afyi iyi inyashi la eko umba rifo mbala eko umba o ra la ɛmɛ mu kwuwo. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />La lu lɛ Ukpo kaa ɛnya irima yi, lakwu mu iwo mo, <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />moo aakwu afyi iyi inyashi iyɛkuu iyi o do ma yi dɛ mo ngbaa te Ukpo e wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le nzhii ba ɔnɛ, ba o gba o ma ɛlɛ te gbee fo. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Akwiyi gba afyi ɛnyi o gyi yi riba ma mo, onzu uwu e do irima e yi mo; Tetete kwuwongu enzu umba Ukpo a ŋa mba, afyi ɛnyi o gyi yi riba ma. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu, gba onzu uwunawuna a za yi te &lt;La lu yese, Okrasi a ŋɔ munɛ ele!&gt; naa a za yi te &lt;A ŋɔ aawu!&gt; la lu nyama mo. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Moo enzu umba o ya ɛmba te Okrasi mbala anukenzu umba angba oo wɔ, oo wo lɔzɔ undɔkwuu mbala apula iyi kenzu iyama kaa lo kyoro enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa mba awu mo, gba i wo mbo mo. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu ngbɛndu; mi so yi apula lɛɛbi keyi-e.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Igbama Iyi Umɛ Uwu Onzu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Omatiyu 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Oluku 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;Mizhikembo iyi inyashi ɛnyi akwɛyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">&lt;&lt; &lt;ɔnu uu lo ipwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">ɔvya ba u lemo mo;<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />elovyo i kala i fu mɛzhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">akwɛyi Ukpo e wo apula iyi oshi lɛɛbi akpa.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Mu kwuye kwɔngu enzu o ma Umɛ uwu Onzu te e yi mu inyɔma, aa wɔ mu amu iyoshi, la ekpasu, mbala inzumbɛku. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Akwɛyi a lɔ alɔgbulɔ wu ma kaa lo kpala wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi umba bɔkɔ o ŋa mba ɛlu, umba eko ekpendo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, i na mu imbwama iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ nzhii ba mu imbwama iyoshi.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kiya Ingyi Ivɔngɔma Mbaa Uwɛyi Uwu Oboriyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Omatiyu 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Oluku 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />&lt;&lt;La lu vɔngɔ kiya mu uwɛyi uwu oboriyo: Akwiyi gba u le mu epu itumo akwɛyi epu i le mu iwɔma, la lu yitu te iwo i ndafo. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Tatayi gba lu ma apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi, la lu yitu te kwuye kwu ndafo, kwu bo kɛlɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le te, ɔyi ɔlɛ u rimo mo nzhii ba ɛlɛ lɛɛbi ii wo dɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Oshi mbala ɛzhi u bomo, iso mi ba i bomo mo.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onzu Uwunawuna E Yitu Iyi Kwɔfyi Naa Kwuye Kwɔngwu Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Omatiyu 24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna e yitu iyi kwɔfyi naa kwuye mo, alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo moshi lala o yitu mo, Umɛ tete e yitu mo, Ada kɛɛkyi gba e yitu le. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Kwuwo kwɔngu la lu ngbɛndu! La lu rima la lu gbomo! Moo lu yitu iyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ kwɔfyi kwɔngu kwu nyɔ mo. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />I yi kyamate onzu uwufo uwu bɔkɔ e sheye mu luzɛ tayi: A lafya la kwogba wu mewo iyi ɛmɛgba wu, akwɛyi e shi onzonzu ɛduma wu kaa le wo, akwɛyi a za la uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu kenzugwu awu te la ngbɛndu.<verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwongwu la lu ngbɛndu, moo lu yitu iyi kwuyengwu Ɔkwu uwu kwogba a ba gbama mo, ta a ba kwu mu onoyo, naa mutu uweka, naa mutu uwu eyi i lama i lama, naa mu awalɔkyi. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Akwiyi gba e ngyi kporo, le du yi te lu yi mu ondo ikpolomo mo. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ mi so yi le, mi so la uwewe te: &lt;La lu yɛnwu ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Watokeyi Umba Azhu O Ka Amasa Iyi Kaa Lo Yi Ɔzhizɔsi Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Omatiyu 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Oluku 22.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Ɔzhɔnu 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />kwuye ungwu odumudumu uwu ikalama uwu kiya ingyi rimo ingyi bɔkɔ ki yi otutu mo, ku shi kyamate afyi epo te akwɛyi ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi, o le mu amasa ikama iyi o yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo wɛrɛrɛ kaa lo ngbɛ wu ma. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Umba ba o so mbala esu tee, &lt;&lt;Lakwu kwuyengwu odumudumu mo, moo ovyo e be yimo mekeka iyi enzu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="ms">O La Ɔzhizɔsi Anyi Mu Ɔbɛtani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Omatiyu 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Ɔzhɔnu 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yi mu Ɔbɛtani mu kwogba ungwu Ɔsamɔ, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi ofya umbu embyi umbɔyi dɛ awu. Kwuye ungwu kiya ingyirimo ingyi onoyo, okokpayi uwufo e bo la ogya uwu anyi umba abwa, umba umbwɔ ferere, anyi mbamba o wo mbo mu uwɛyi uwu o ya wu te onadi, a wu mba ma akwɛyi e fu mbo Ɔzhizɔsi mu reshi.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Enzu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi mɔmɔ awu o wo amba gyɔɔ akwɛyi o so mbala esu te, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi bɔkɔ anyi umba abwa mbɔlɛ o wo mbo ishi te? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Anyi mbɔlɛ gba o ya mba ma o yi eduwo iyi kari iyi onzu uwu ɛduma ma kwuyengwu Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi eduwo ɛnyi o shi yi ayirewa.&gt;&gt; O tu okokpayi awu ma gyɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;La lu lu wu afyima kyoo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki wo bɔkɔ lu towu mo? E wo kiya ingyesheshi e shi mi. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Lunyi lu yi mbala ayirewa kwuye ungunanguna ba lu mbwa mba ma kwuye ungunanguna ba lu gyi, imi ba mi yi mbala yi kwuye ungunanguna mo. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />E wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ i fate le wo, e fulo anyi mbɔlɛ e fu mi mɛnwu, e wo ɛlɛ kaa la nɔngɔ ukpɛzhi mi ma keyi laa ipumo mi. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le te, munamuna bɔkɔ o tanu iyi ilɔ iyesheshi ɛlɛ mu kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi o so kiya ingyi okokpayi ele e wo, kaa la ku ilolomo wu.<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ozhuda A Nyama Kaa La Ya Ɔzhizɔsi Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Omatiyu 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Oluku 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Akwɛyi Ozhuda Isikariyɔ, onzu ukpɛnyi mekeka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya wewo la wepo mbamba, a ka mbaa ebwoshi umbakɔ kaa la ya la Ɔzhizɔsi ma le shi mbo. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Tabɔkɔ e so mbo tayi, o mwɔnyɛ akwɛyi o gyiri kenzu mo te o shi wu eduwo. Akwɛyi e le mu ɔgwuzɛ ikagyima uwu bɔkɔ e yi Ɔzhizɔsi e shi mbo.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ozhizɔsi E Ri Kiya Ingyirimo Ingyi Odumudumu Uwu Ikalama Mbala Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Omatiyu 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Oluku 22.7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Ɔzhɔnu 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Mu kwɔfyi ungwu kwonze ungwu odumudumu uwu oburedi uwu bɔkɔ e yi otutu mo, kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o wo isabɔ iyi oturukpe uwu ikalama, akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhizɔsi o yo wu kwuyo te &lt;&lt;Muna bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi te la ki so kaa la ki nɔngɔ ŋɔ kizɛ mɔgɔ uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ ri kiya ingyi ikalama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Akwɛyi a lɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wu wepo ma, a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu so mɛmi iyi kwuse, lu ma onzu uwufo ta a za la kudu ungwu embi, la lu mbwalu wu. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />La lu za la ɔkwu uwu kwogba ungwu e fye te, &lt;U zɔ kiya a zɔ te: Muna ba akwu ugu uwu agboga, muna ba mi ri kiya ingyirimo ingyi ikalama mbala Wavɔngɔkiya mi? <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Ee to yi e re ye mu ugwu uwoshi uwakuu uwu bɔkɔ o fu wu lɔgyi-a. La lu nɔngɔ wu nzu ma mɔmɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu mbɔlɛ o ka mɛmi iyi kwuse akwɛyi o ko ma apula kyamate bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e so mbo awu. Akwɛyi o nɔngɔ kiya ingyirimo ingyi ikalama ma.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />kwuyengwu onoyo, Ɔzhizɔsi a ka mɔmɔ mbala wavɔngɔ kiya wu wewo la wepo mbamba. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu kiya irimo mu oteburu akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi za mba te, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo mɛɛ, onzu ukpɛnyi meka yi a ya mi ma, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu kiya irimo mbala mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Idu mbo i tutu mo iyɛkɛkɔ akwɛyi o le wo mu kwuyo i yomo kɛnyi kɛnyi te, &lt;&lt;Aku imi re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />A gba mba opwu te, &lt;&lt;Akwu onzu ukpɛnyi meka yi wewo la wepo mbɔlɛ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e lo kwuwo mu kaatu mbala mi. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Umɛ uwu Onzu e ri mo kyamate bɔkɔ o ka o ta mɛzhi tayi. Ikyakwokwo akwu iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to Umɛ uwu Onzu a yama! Lo mba wu mo lala i bi ka wu woshi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kiya Ingyirimo Ingyi Onoyo Ingyi Ɔkwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Omatiyu 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Oluku 22.14-20</ref>; 1 Ɔkɔrɛtiya 11.23-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu kiya irimo bɛnɛ, Ɔzhizɔsi e to kwoburedi akwɛyi a gbɛlɛ ɛnyi, a mu ngu ma akwɛyi e shi Wavɔngɔkiya wu, a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;La lu na kaa lu ri. Ɛlɛ akwu ɛnwu mi .&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Akwɛyi e to ago, a gbɛlɛ ɛnyi akwɛyi e shi mbo, akwɛyi lɛɛbi mba o wo.<verse eid="MRK 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Mbɔlɛ o yi kyamate ɛnzhi mi umba kenzu igyirima, umba bɔkɔ o fumo kuwongwu enzu lɛɛbi tayi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />&lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo te, mi gba mi wo embyi umba imuma iyi ɛwɛyi mbɔlɛ fo, nzhii ba kwɔfyi kwɔngu bɔkɔ mi bi wo umbepo kwuyengwu irɛsu iyi Ukpo moshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />O so kwɔmu akwɛyi o ka mu Lɔwa ungwu Ɔlifu.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Kpeke Tee Opita A Zɔ Ku zɔ Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Omatiyu 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Oluku 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Ɔzhɔnu 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Lɛɛbi yi, lu gba kembo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;moo o ka yi o ta mɛzhi te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">&lt;&lt; &lt;Mi fya u gbo ilɔ kiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">akwɛyi ilɔ mbamba o kpashaa.&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mo mu kwuvɔ, mi to keyi la yi mi re mu Ogalili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Akwɛyi Opita a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba enzu lɛɛbi o gba kembo lala, Imi mi gba kembo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Mi so ŋɔ ongbulolo mɛɛ, mutu uwɔnɛ, uŋɔ Opita ŋɔ zɔ kwu zɔ mi izhela dɛgba okuru e to ɛyi izhepo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Opita ba a kyakpɔ mu isomo gedegede te, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi gba mi kpomo mbala ŋa lala, mi zɔ ku zɔ ŋɔ mo.&gt;&gt; Te gba Wavɔngɔkiya umba bɔkɔ o shimo awu o so le tete.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lɛ Ukpo Mu Ɔgɛsɛmani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Omatiyu 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Oluku 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o bo mu kizɛ ingyi bɔkɔ o ya ngyi te Ɔgɛsɛmani, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu te, &lt;&lt;La lu ŋɔma munɛ kaa la mi so tayi kaa la mi lɛ Ukpo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />E to Opita, Ozhemisi mbala Ɔzhɔnu mbala wu, akwɛyi e le mu ubugyi iwomo, egbo wu i fomo gyɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;kwundu mi ku wo ubugyi nzhii ika mba lukwu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;La lu ŋɔ munɛ, kaa la lu gbomo mbala mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Tabɔkɔ e turu a ka keyi bwɛɛ, akwɛyi e kpo eyi mɛzhi akwɛyi a lɛ Ukpo te, gba iwomo, kwuye ngwɔlɛ lakwu pika wu ma. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />A zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ada, Ada&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;apula lɛɛbi i ka ŋa ma mo. To ago ɛlɛ ma munyi mi. Tetete, la kwiyi bɔkɔ mi gyi le mo, la kwiyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Akwɛyi a gba a ka mbaa Wavɔngɔkiya wu akwɛyi e du mbo te o yi mu ondo ikpolomo. Akwɛyi a za la Opita te, &lt;&lt;Ɔsamɔ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ yi mu ondo ikpolomo? Ŋɔ do te ŋɔ gbomo kwuye bwɛɛ moo? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />La lu rima mu igbomo kaa la lu lɛ Ukpo kaa la lu fye meka iyi imondo mo. Kwundu kwu gyi kpɔɔ, ɛnwu ba i finyashi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />A gba a ka ma mba Ukpo ilɛma kpɔɔ, a lɛ kyamate e koko e wo awu. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ a gbama, a gba e du mbo mu ondo kpɔɔ, kuwongwu eyi mbo akwiyi ondo. O yitu iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o so mo.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a gbama ungwola akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;Lu yi mu ondo ikpolomo mbala ɛnwu ingbomo bɛnɛ? Ikpo kya ŋa! Moo kwuye kwu bo kɛlɛ-ɛ. La lu yese, Umɛ uwu Onzu o ya wu ma la enzu umba ingbomo-o. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />La lu yimo! La ki sheyimo! Onzu uwu e to mi e shi mbo le a nyɔ le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Yi Ɔzhizɔsi Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Omatiyu 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Oluku 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Ɔzhɔnu 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Tabɔkɔ e yi mu iso isomo bɛnɛ akwɛyi Ozhuda, uwu bɔkɔ akwu ukpɛnyi mekeka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhizɔsi wewo la wepo mbamba, e ngyi mbala riba ingyi asozha. O za la lopo undu ewa itomo mbala engbule, ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi gba o lɔ mba le. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />U to onzu u yama awu e shi mbo kɛzɔ kpeke te: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ mi kpa wu idu, uwu gba a ŋawu; La lu yi wu mo kaa la lu sheyimo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ozhuda a ngbɛ ngbulolo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Gbɛgyɛ loo U zɔ kiya,&gt;&gt; akwɛyi a kpa wu idu. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Enzu mbamba o yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo akwɛyi o ra wu gbagiri. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Akwɛyi onzu ukpɛnyi meka iyi umba bɔkɔ o rima mɔmɔ a ka la kuwo mbaa kepo wu, a wa nga ma akwɛyi e kpolo umɛgba uwu obwoshi uwakɔ kwɔlu ma.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Imi mi kwu uwɛlɔ re bɔkɔ lu wɔ kudu la lopo undewa mbala engbule kaa la lu yi mi moo? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba te, kwɔfyi kwɔfyi mi yi mbala yi mu ɔtɛpu, lunyi ba lu yi mi mo. Iso iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e so, ba i nyɔlɔma mega.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu lɛɛbi o renya o shi wu. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Ulugbaga ɔnzɔnu uwufo uwu bɔkɔ e lo okpayi uwu ɔlinɛ bi a mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mizhikembo. Kwuye ungwu o yi wu mo, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />uwu ba a lu apula wu e fu mɛzhi akwɛyi a renya a kama la uzhi uwidɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Rima Mu Keyi Unga Odudu Uwu Wa To Keyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Omatiyu 26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Oluku 22.54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Ɔzhɔnu 18.13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Akwɛyi o to Ɔzhizɔsi o ka mu kwogba ungu obwoshi uwakɔ, mbaa ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ mbala wazɔ kiya ingyi ɛrama o kpala ɛlu. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Opita ba a mbwalu wu sharu nzhii ba a ka mu okpulo uwu ebwoshi umbakɔ. Mɔmɔ Opita a ka ŋɔma mbala adakari mu ɔyi ivyemo.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Eboshi umbakɔ mbala wa to keyi lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ awu o kagyi izɔgɔ iyi bɔkɔ i shi kaa lo ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi ma, umba ba o fya mo. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Enzu gyɔɔ o zɔ izɔgɔ iyi imulo, iso mbo ba akwu ongbulolo mo.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Akwɛyi onzu uwufo e yimo akwɛyi a mulo Ɔzhizɔsi: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />&lt;&lt;Ki pwa ta bɔkɔ a zɔ te, &lt;Mi shiri ɔtɛpu uwu bɔkɔ onzu e mbo le mo akwɛyi mu afyi ela mi gbala uwufo imbomo uwu bɔkɔ akwu uwu onzu e mbo le fo.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Tetete izɔgɔ mba akwu engbulolo mo.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Akwɛyi obwoshi uwakɔ e yi a rima mu keyi mbo akwɛyi e yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Imulo iyi bɔkɔ enzu mbɔlɛ o mu o lo ŋɔ le, ŋɔ gba opwu ma yi mo re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a ŋɔ kyoo, a gba opwu mo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Obwoshi uwakɔ e yo wu kwuyo kpɔ, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Okrasi, Umɛ uwu Ukpo uwu esheshi le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ee akwu imi.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ ma Umɛ uwu Onzu te a ŋɔma mu kwuwo ngungyi ungwu Edego-ala, te a zɛ mu amwu iyoshi a nyɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Oboshi uwakɔ a tara ɔmu wu ma akwɛyi a zɔ te. &lt;&lt;Ki kagyi izɔgɔ iyina kpɔɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />&lt;&lt;Lu pwa mate bɔkɔ e pe Ukpo ari. Amasa yi i yi te?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">O nyama kyaa o zɔ te e do lukwu mo. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Akwɛyi umbafo o kwo wo mɔtɛ ikpomo; o ma wu eyi mo, o kpa wu afyi akwɛyi o za wu te, &lt;&lt;So nzu, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a kpa ŋa afyi!&gt;&gt; Adakari o to wu mo akwɛyi o kpa wu ɛmu.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opita A Zɔ Kwu zɔ Ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Omatiyu 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Oluku 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Ɔzhɔnu 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Tabɔkɔ Opita a ŋɔma mu okpulo akwɛyi Umɛgba okokpayi uwu obwoshi uwakɔ ukpɛnyi e bo. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Tabɔkɔ a ma Opita te e yi mu ɔyi ivyemo, e yese wu marimari.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:67">Akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt; Uŋɔ ŋɔ yi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazɛrɛti awu tete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Uwu ba a zɔma. A zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Mi yitu mo ba mi zɔngɔma iso iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi mu isomo mo,&gt;&gt; akwɛyi a wɔ kwudu iyawu mu kenzugu kɛlɛlɛ okuru e tɛyi.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Kwuye ungwu Umɛgba okokpayi ele a ma wu mɔmɔ, a za la enzu umba bɔkɔ o rima kɛlɛ mɔmɔ awu kpɔ te, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu onzu ukpɛnyi mekeka mba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Opita a zɔma kpɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Kwuye bwɛɛ, enzu umba bɔkɔ o rima kɛlɛ mbala wu awu o za wu te, &lt;&lt;Iyesheshi ŋɔ kwu onzu ukpɛnyi meka mba, moo ŋɔ kwu onzu uwu umba Ogalili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Akwɛyi Opita ele mu ivungɔma te iyira li du wu, akwɛyi e to la kiya te, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele mi yi wu mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Mu kwotota kwɔngu okwuru e to ɛyi ungwopo. Akwɛyi Opita e lolo iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhzhizɔsi e so wu awu te: &lt;&lt;Keyi kaa okwuru le to ɛyi izhepo, ŋɔ zɔ kwu zɔ mi izhela.&gt;&gt; ɛnwu ikpo wu mo akwɛyi e le mu oga ilomo.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">O Ka Laa Ɔzhizɔsi Midu Iyi Opayileti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Omatiyu 27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Oluku 23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Ɔzhɔnu 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Mu kwoto biri ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ mbala wazɔ kiya ingyi ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala enzu umbakɔ umba udaba lɛɛbi o kpala ɛlu. O ma Ɔzhizɔsi ma akwɛyi o towu o ka mbaa Opayileti.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Opayileti e yo wu te, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu ɔsu uwu Azhu lee?&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu te, &lt;&lt;Ee, kyamate bɔkɔ ŋɔ so awu tegba i yi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Eboshi umbakɔ o mulo wu meka iyi apula ikikɔ ikikɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ Opayileti e yo wu kwuyo kpɔ te, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ŋɔ gba mi opwu mo re? Yese apula riba iyi bɔkɔ o mu o lo ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu mo, ɛlɛ i shi Opayileti kenzu iyama.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="ms">O Ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi Ombwu Uwu Lukwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Omatiyu 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Oluku 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Ɔzhɔnu 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />kwuyengwu odumudumu uwu ikalama, o koko o wa la onzu ukpɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ enzu o nda ma mu ugu ugyi. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Onzu uwufo o ya wu te Obarabasi e yi mu ugu ugyi mbala enzu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o ngbɛ onzu kwuyengwu ovyo e yi mo. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Riba ingyi enzu o bo mbaa Opayileti akwɛyi o za wu te le wo mbo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e koko e wo mbo awu.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Opayileti e yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Lu gyi te kaa la mi lafya la ɔsu uwu umba Azhu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Moo e yitu te anya wu gba ebwoshi umbakɔ o wo le. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Eboshi umbakɔ o lo riba ingyi enzu mbamba mu ubu te lo so Opayileti te la lafya la Obarabasi.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Akwɛyi Opayileti e yo kwuyo te, &lt;&lt;Mi wo te fo mbala onzu ele uwu bɔkɔ lu ya wu te ɔsu uwu umba Azhu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />O wo ovyo o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Lo kpa wu mu kuwɛyi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Opayileti e yo mbo te, &lt;&lt;Kwuwo ungwu kwuwongumbe? Ingbomo iyina bɔkɔ e wo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Umba ba o wo ovyo mu opwu uwɔkwu te, &lt;&lt;Lo kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Kwuwongwu bɔkɔ Opayileti a gyi te le wo iyi bɔkɔ i she la enzu awu, akwɛyi a wa la Obarabasi e shi mbo. A fya Ɔzhizɔsi izele akwɛyi e shi wu mbo kaa lo kpa wu mu kuwɛyi.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asozha O Wo Ɔzhizɔsi Ɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Omatiyu 27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Ɔzhɔnu 19.2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Asozha o to Ɔzhizɔsi o ka wu mu kizɛ ingyi bɔkɔ o ya ngyi te Ɔpuratɛriyɔ akwɛyi o ya uzhi uwu asozha ma lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />O kpo Ɔzhizɔsi ɛkiri mɛnwu akwɛyi o ndo kese unga awula o bɔ wu mu reshi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Akwɛyi o to wu ɛnyi o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Baagayidu, Ɔsu uwu umba Azhu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />O fya wu kwonga mu reshi, o kpo wu ɔtɛ akwɛyi o bɔ epunu mɛzhi o lemo. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Akwɛyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o mbwa wu ɛnɛ iwomo, o lu wu ɛkiri awu ma mɛnwu akwɛyi o kpo wu ekpayi wu mɛnwu. Akwɛyi o to wu o ka te lo kpa wu mu kuwɛyi.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Bɔ Ɔzhizɔsi Iba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Omatiyu 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Oluku 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Ɔzhɔnu 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Onzu uwufo a wɔ mu Osarini, o ya wu te Ɔsamɔ, ete uwu Alɛkizanda mbala Orufu, e yi mu ikakama e sheyi mu kwuse, akwɛyi o wo wu mɛga kaa le shi kuwɛyi ungwu lukwu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />O bo la Ɔzhizɔsi mu Ɔgɔlugɔta (iluma yi i yi te, Kizɛ ingyi akɔgɔ iyi reshi). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Akwɛyi o shi wu embyi umba iwuma umba bɔkɔ o yoro mbo mo mbala omari, uwu ba e towu iwomo. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Akwɛyi o kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu. Akwɛyi o ka ɛriga wu ma, akwɛyi o nyɛpwu kaa lo ma kiya ingyi uwewe a fya.<verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Akwu mu ɔnɔnda gba o kpa wu mu kuwɛyi le. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Akwɛyi o ka ɛzu o kpa mu kadu unga kwuwɛyi kwɔngu te: ƆSU UWU UMBA AZHU. <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />O kpa awɛlɔ wepo mbala wu tete, ukpɛnyi e yi mu kuwo ungwungyi wu, uwufo ba e yi mu kuwo ungwu ɔzu wu. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />O kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi mbala awɛlɔ wepo, uwufo e yi mu kwuwo ungwungyi wu akwɛyi uwufo ba e yi mu kwuwo ungwɔzu. <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ikakama o kpa wu ari, o mi reshi, o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ shiri ɔtɛpu ma akwɛyi ŋɔ gba wa la imbomo ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwola le, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />kalama mu kuwɛyi kwɔlɛ kaa sa ɛŋɔ ŋɔ ma ŋa nɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Tatayi gba ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ o wo Ɔzhizɔsi ɛnɛ le tete. O zɔ te, &lt;&lt;A sa enzu umbafo ma ba e do ɛnwu wu isama mo! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Okrasi ele, Ɔsu uwu Izirɛ ele, la kalama mu kuwɛyi ungwu lukwu kwɔlɛ ka la ki ma, akwɛyi ki fulo idu ma wu.&gt;&gt; Enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpa mba mu kuwɛyi mbala wu awu, o kpa wu ari tete.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukwu Undu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Omatiyu 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Oluku 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Ɔzhɔnu 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Kwuye ungwu ɔnɔnda ipu i kpo mɛzhi munamuna nzhii so mu kwuyengwu ekerepe ela. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Akwɛyi kwuye ugu ekerepe ela Ɔzhizɔsi e lo oga mu opwu uwɔkuu te, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɔyi, Ɛlɔyi, lama sabatani?&gt;&gt; iyi bɔkɔ o lu yi te, &lt;&lt;Ukpo mi, Ukpo mi, I wo te ŋɔ lu mi afyima te?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Kuye ungwu bɔkɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ o ri kɛlɛ mɔmɔ awu o pwa ɛlɛ, o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;La lu yese e yi mu Elazha iyama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Onzu ɛnyi meka mba a renya a ka e ke to amegbere, a nyɔlɔ ngwu ma mbala embyi umba bɔkɔ o wuma, a bɔ ngwu mu kuwɛyi akwɛyi e shi Ɔzhizɔsi kaa le wo. Enzu o za wu te &lt;&lt;Shiwobi, la ki mate Elazha a nyɔ a ba sa wu ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ta oga kpaa, akwɛyi e fu ɛnyɔ imbwambwaa.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Akwɛyi okpayi uwu kenzugu unga ɔtɛpu a tara ma yaa i wɔ moshi nzhii ba e bo mɛzhi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Kuye ungwu u to keyi uwu asozha uwu bɔkɔ e ri midu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi awu, a pwa oga mbala ewo iyi bɔkɔ e kpomo awu, a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele e ku Umɛ uwu Ukpo kego!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ekokpayi umbafo o yi mu iyesemo sharu. Eko mbamba aku, Omeri Omagadali, Omeri anyi uwu Ozhemisi uwɛri mbala Ozhosesi, mbala Osalomi. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Eko mbɔlɛ o mbwalu wu mu Ogalili akwɛyi o sa Ɔzhizɔsi igɔ ma. Eko gyɔɔ umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu wu o ka mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ le o yɔmɔ tete.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ipwumo Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Omatiyu 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Oluku 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Ɔzhɔnu 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Mu onoyo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o yi mu ɛnwuyimo iyi kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Ɔzhɔsɛfu uwu Arimatiya, onzu ukpɛnyi meka iyi wa to keyi, uwu bɔkɔ e rigbo la irɛsu iyoshi a ka mbaa Opayileti, a ka nda ukpɛzhi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Ɛlɛ i shi Opayileti kenzu iyama ta bɔkɔ a pwa te e kpomo-o le. A lɔ la U to keyi uwu asozha kaa le bo akwɛyi e yo kwuyo te, Ɔzhizɔsi e kpomo-o. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Kuye ungwu bɔkɔ Opayileti a pwa mɔgɔ uwu u to keyi uwu asozha awu te e kpomo-o, akwɛyi e shi Ɔzhɔsɛfu ukpɛzhi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔsɛfu e bo la okpayi uwu ɔlinɛ, e to ukpɛzhi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi ma, akwɛyi a ta ukpɛzhi awu mu ogariwu uwu o vu mu kwokyi. Akwɛyi e mbiri kwokyi e fulo mu kenzu unga ogariwu awu. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Omeri Omagadali mbala Omeri anyi wu Ozhosesi o ma mɔgɔ uwu bɔkɔ o ta wu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Yimo Mu Kwuvɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Omatiyu 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Oluku 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Ɔzhɔnu 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Mizhikembo iyi kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo, Omeri Omagadali mbala Omeri anyi wu Ozhemisi mbala Osalomi, o ya apula iyi umbwɔ ferere, kaa lo so lo ngbɛ ukpɛzhi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Mu kwoto mu kwoto ɔnu uwu kwonze ungwu rishi, kwuyengwu ɔnu u yi mu iwɔma bɛnɛ, o zɛ o sheyimo mbaa ogariwu. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Akwɛyi o le mu esu eyo iyomo te, &lt;&lt;Uwe ba a fya nzu kwokyi ungwu ku yi mu kenzu unga ogariwu awu ma ngyɔɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Tabɔkɔ o yi eyi mbo faa, akwɛyi o ma te kwokyi ungwɔku kwɔngu o fya ngwu ma mu kenzugu unga ogariwu ma-a. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Tabɔkɔ o fye mu ogariwu, akwɛyi o ma onzu uwufo uwu bɔkɔ e lo ekpayi iruwu, a ŋɔma mu emba akwɛyi izele i yi mbo mo.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Akwɛyi a za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu wiyi mo.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Lu yi mu Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti uwu bɔkɔ o kpawu mu kuwɛyi awu ikagyima. E yimo mu kwuvɔ-ɔ! E yi munɛ fo. La lu yese mɔgɔ uwu o shi wu. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Lunyi ba la lu so kaa la lu za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu mbala Opita te, &lt;E to keyi la mba a ka mu Ogalili-e. Lu ma wu mɔmɔ kyamate bɔkɔ e so yi e shi mɛzhi tayi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Akwɛyi o fulomo efyefya mbaa ogariwu la iyi mbala ɛnwu ipulama. O so onzu ukpɛnyi iso mo kuwongwu iyi i wo mbo mo.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Ɛnwu Ma Laa Omeri Omagadali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Omatiyu 28.9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Ɔzhɔnu 20.11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e yimo mu kwuvɔ mu kwoto ungwu kwɔfyi ungwu kwonze ungwu rishi, a zɔ ɛnwu wu ma la Omeri Omagadali, uwu bɔkɔ a ra wu la eyo umbeyi werewo awu ma. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Akwɛyi a ka za la enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala wu ba o yi mu obobyi iwomo mbala oga wu ilomo awu. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Kwuye ungwu o pwa te Ɔzhizɔsi e yi la reyi, ba Omeri Omagadali la a ma wu, o nyama mo.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Ɛnwu Ma Laa Wambwalu Wepo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Oluku 24.13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi, Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ ɛnwu ma la enzu wepo mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔwa kwuyengwu o yi mu luzɛ o she mu kwuse. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Enzu wepo mbamba o gbama o ka mba Wavɔngɔkiya umba bɔkɔ o shi mo awu o ko so mbo; Umba ba o nya mba ma mo.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Ɛnwu Ma Laa Wewo La Ukpɛnyi Mbamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Omatiyu 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Oluku 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Ɔzhɔnu 20.19-23</ref>; Ɛduma Iyi Wa zɛ ilɔ 1.6-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ ɛnwu ma la Wavɔngɔkiya wewo la Ukpɛnyi umba bɔkɔ o shimo awu, kwuye ungwu o yi mu kiya irimo; e tu mbo mo kuwongwu o kwu idu lu fulo mo ba o towo iso iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o ma wu mizhikembo iyi e yimo mu lukwu awu mo.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />A za mba te, &lt;&lt;La lu so mu kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa la lu tanu iyi ilɔ iyesheshi la enzu. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a nyama ba o wo wu obatisima o sa wu ma, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a nyama mo o zɔ ombu wu. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Lɔzɔ luu mbwalu enzu umba bɔkɔ o nyama: Mu ɛnyi mi o rala eyombeyi mo o wɔ kwudu; oo so lunzu undopo; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />o kwu akwu mewo mbo akwɛyi kwuyengwu o wo ɛtu, i wo mbo kiya mo; o fulo ewo mbo mu enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu efya ipwama akwɛyi efya mba i bomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O To Ɔzhizɔsi Mo O Kawa Moshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Oluku 24.50-53</ref>; Ɛduma Iyi Wa zɛ ilɔ 1.9-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa mba iso ɛnyi isomo, o to wu mo a ka moshi a ka ŋɔma mu kuwo ungwungyi ungu Ukpo. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya o ka mu anu itama munamuna mu kwudu, Ɔkwu e wo ɛduma mbala mba akwɛyi a zɔ ɛduma wu ma mu lɔzɔ izɔma.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>